Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js","Interface utilisateur intuitive et facile à utiliser","Analyse de données et génération de rapports"],"de":["Benutzerdefiniertes Programmmanagement","Prozessoptimierung mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Intuitive und benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche","Datenanalyse und Berichterstellung"],"pt":["Gestão de programas de assignatura","Integração com a Facultad de Ciencias Exactas y Tecnologia","Ferramentas de AI para otimização de processos","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos usuários"],"ru":["Управление программами","Интеграция с Факультетом Exactas y Tecnologia","ИИ инструменты для оптимизации процессов","Интуитивный интерфейс","Поддержка多пользовательской среды"],"ar":["إدارة برامج المساقات","التكامل مع الكلية التكنولوجية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين العمليات","واجهة المستخدم البسيطة","دعم بيئة متعددة المستخدمين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira Epic教程","AIエージェント是什么","项目管理工具比较","Jira Epic安装","Jira Epic设置指南","如何使用Jira Epic","Jira Epic替代品"],"ja":["Jira Epicチュートリアル","AIエージェントとは","プロジェクト管理ツール比較","Jira Epicインストール","Jira Epic設定ガイド","Jira Epicの使用方法","Jira Epicの代替"],"ko":["Jira Epic 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트란","프로젝트 관리 도구 비교","Jira Epic 설치","Jira Epic 설정 가이드","Jira Epic 사용 방법","Jira Epic 대체"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para la gestión de programas","cómo utilizar Jira Epic","Jira Epic vs Trello","instalación de Jira Epic","guía de configuración de Jira Epic","programas de gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software con React y Node.js"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour la gestion de programmes","comment utiliser Jira Epic","Jira Epic vs Trello","installation de Jira Epic","guide de configuration de Jira Epic","programmes de gestion de projets","développement de logiciels avec React et Node.js"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz-Tools für das Programmmanagement","wie man Jira Epic verwendet","Jira Epic vs Trello","Installation von Jira Epic","Konfigurationsanleitung für Jira Epic","Programme für das Projektmanagement","Softwareentwicklung mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["jira-epic","gestão de programas de assignatura","ferramentas de AI","Facultad de Ciencias Exactas y Tecnologia","como usar jira-epic","o que é jira-epic","jira-epic vs trello","jira-epic instalação","guia de configuração jira-epic"],"ru":["jira-epic","управление программами","ИИ инструменты","Факультет Exactas y Tecnologia","как использовать jira-epic","что такое jira-epic","jira-epic vs trello","установка jira-epic","руководство по настройке jira-epic"],"ar":["جيرا-إيبك","إدارة برامج المساقات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","الكلية التكنولوجية","كيفية استخدام جيرا-إيبك","ما هو جيرا-إيبك","جيرا-إيبك vs تrello","تثبيت جيرا-إيبك","دليل إعداد جيرا-إيبك"]}},"owner":"ic-facet","repo":"gestion-programas-asignatura","repoPath":"ic-facet/gestion-programas-asignatura","stars":0,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T16:11:00Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-epic","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when creating Jira epics for:\n- Large features spanning multiple components\n- New views/pages in the application\n- Major refactoring initiatives\n- Features requiring API + UI + SDK work\n\n## Epic Template\n\n```markdown\n# {Epic Title}\n\n**Figma:** {figma link if available}\n\n## Feature Overview\n\n{2-3 paragraph description of what this feature does and why it''s needed}\n\n## Requirements\n\n### {Section 1: Major Functionality Area}\n\n#### {Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requir","body":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when creating Jira epics for:\n- Large features spanning multiple components\n- New views/pages in the application\n- Major refactoring initiatives\n- Features requiring API + UI + SDK work\n\n## Epic Template\n\n```markdown\n# {Epic Title}\n\n**Figma:** {figma link if available}\n\n## Feature Overview\n\n{2-3 paragraph description of what this feature does and why it''s needed}\n\n## Requirements\n\n### {Section 1: Major Functionality Area}\n\n#### {Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requirement 2\n- Requirement 3\n\n#### {Another Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requirement 2\n\n### {Section 2: Another Major Area}\n\n#### {Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requirement 2\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n### Performance\n- {Performance requirement 1}\n- {Performance requirement 2}\n\n### Data Integration\n- {Data source}\n- {Integration points}\n\n### UI Components\n- {Component 1}\n- {Component 2}\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n- [ ] {Major deliverable 1}\n- [ ] {Major deliverable 2}\n- [ ] {Major deliverable 3}\n\n## Diagrams\n\n{Mermaid diagrams for architecture, flow, data model, etc.}\n```\n\n## Epic Title Conventions\n\nFormat: `[EPIC] Feature Name`\n\n**Examples:**\n- `[EPIC] Findings View`\n- `[EPIC] Multi-tenant Support`\n- `[EPIC] Compliance Dashboard Redesign`\n- `[EPIC] GovCloud Support`\n\n## Required Sections\n\n### 1. Feature Overview\nBrief but complete description of:\n- What the feature does\n- Who uses it\n- Why it''s needed\n\n### 2. Requirements\nOrganized by functional area:\n- Group related requirements together\n- Use clear headers and subheaders\n- Be specific and testable\n\n### 3. Technical Considerations\nAlways include:\n- **Performance**: Large dataset handling, pagination, caching\n- **Data Integration**: Data sources, APIs, relationships\n- **UI Components**: Reusable components, design system usage\n\n### 4. Implementation Checklist\nHigh-level deliverables that will become individual tasks:\n- Each checkbox = potential Jira task\n- Order by dependency (API before UI)\n- Include testing milestones\n\n## Diagrams\n\nUse Mermaid for:\n\n### Architecture Diagrams\n```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    UI[UI Components] --> API[API Endpoints]\n    API --> SDK[Prowler SDK]\n    SDK --> Cloud[Cloud Providers]\n```\n\n### Data Flow Diagrams\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    User->>UI: Apply filters\n    UI->>API: GET /findings?filters\n    API->>DB: Query findings\n    DB-->>API: Results\n    API-->>UI: JSON response\n    UI-->>User: Render table\n```\n\n### State Diagrams\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Pending\n    Pending --> InProgress: Start triage\n    InProgress --> Resolved: Mark resolved\n    InProgress --> Pending: Reset\n    Resolved --> [*]\n```\n\n### Entity Relationship Diagrams\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    FINDING ||--o{ RESOURCE : affects\n    FINDING }|--|| CHECK : \"belongs to\"\n    RESOURCE }|--|| ACCOUNT : \"belongs to\"\n    ACCOUNT }|--|| PROVIDER : \"belongs to\"\n```\n\n## Splitting Epic into Tasks\n\nAfter creating the epic, generate individual tasks using the `jira-task` skill:\n\n### Task Naming Pattern\nFrom epic `[EPIC] Findings View`, create:\n- `[FEATURE] Findings table with pagination (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings filters - provider and account (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings detail panel - Overview tab (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings detail panel - Resources tab (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings bulk actions - mute/suppress (API + UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings search functionality (API + UI)`\n\n### Task Dependencies\nAlways specify in each task:\n```markdown\n## Related Tasks\n- Epic: [EPIC] Findings View\n- Blocked by: [task if any]\n- Blocks: [task if any]\n```\n\n## Figma Integration\n\nWhen Figma links are provided:\n- Include main Figma link at top\n- Reference specific frames in relevant sections\n- Example: `https://www.figma.com/design/xxx?node-id=1830-44712&m=dev`\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Epic: [EPIC] {Title}\n\n{Full epic content following template}\n\n---\n\n## Suggested Tasks\n\nBased on this epic, create the following tasks:\n\n| # | Title | Component | Blocked By |\n|---|-------|-----------|------------|\n| 1 | [FEATURE] Task name | API | - |\n| 2 | [FEATURE] Task name | UI | Task 1 |\n| 3 | [FEATURE] Task name | UI | Task 2 |\n\nWould you like me to generate the full task descriptions?\n```\n\n## Checklist Before Submitting\n\n1. ✅ Title follows `[EPIC] Feature Name` format\n2. ✅ Feature Overview explains what/who/why\n3. ✅ Requirements are organized by functional area\n4. ✅ Technical Considerations cover performance, data, UI\n5. ✅ Implementation Checklist has high-level deliverables\n6. ✅ Diagrams included where helpful (Mermaid format)\n7. ✅ Figma links included if available\n8. ✅ Suggested tasks table provided at the end\n\n## Formatting Rules\n\n**CRITICAL:** All output MUST be in Markdown format, ready to paste into Jira.\n\n- Use `#` for epic title, `##` for main sections, `###` for subsections\n- Use `**bold**` for emphasis\n- Use `- [ ]` for checkboxes in Implementation Checklist\n- Use ``` for code blocks and Mermaid diagrams\n- Use `backticks` for file paths, commands, and code references\n- Use tables for Suggested Tasks section\n- Use `---` to separate epic from suggested tasks\n\n## Jira MCP Integration\n\n**CRITICAL:** When creating epics via MCP, use these exact parameters:\n\n### Required Fields\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project_key\": \"PROWLER\",\n  \"summary\": \"[EPIC] Feature name\",\n  \"issue_type\": \"Epic\",\n  \"additional_fields\": {\n    \"customfield_10359\": {\"value\": \"UI\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Team Field (REQUIRED)\n\nThe `customfield_10359` (Team) field is **REQUIRED**. Options:\n- `\"UI\"` - Frontend epics\n- `\"API\"` - Backend epics\n- `\"SDK\"` - Prowler SDK epics\n\n### Work Item Description Field\n\n**IMPORTANT:** The project uses `customfield_10363` (Work Item Description) instead of the standard `description` field for display in the UI.\n\n**CRITICAL:** Use **Jira Wiki markup**, NOT Markdown:\n- `h2.` instead of `##`\n- `*text*` for bold instead of `**text**`\n- `* item` for bullets (same)\n- `** subitem` for nested bullets\n\nAfter creating the epic, update the description with:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"customfield_10363\": \"h2. Feature Overview\\n\\n{overview}\\n\\nh2. Requirements\\n\\n*{Section 1}*\\n* {requirement 1}\\n* {requirement 2}\\n\\n*{Section 2}*\\n* {requirement 1}\\n* {requirement 2}\\n\\nh2. Technical Considerations\\n\\n*Performance:*\\n* {consideration 1}\\n\\n*Data Integration:*\\n* {consideration 2}\\n\\nh2. Implementation Checklist\\n\\n* [ ] {deliverable 1}\\n* [ ] {deliverable 2}\\n* [ ] {deliverable 3}\"\n}\n```\n\n### Linking Tasks to Epic\n\nWhen creating child tasks, use the epic key as parent:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"additional_fields\": {\n    \"parent\": \"PROWLER-XXX\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Workflow Transitions\n\n```\nBacklog (10037) → To Do (14) → In Progress (11) → Done (21)\n                → Blocked (10)\n```\n\n### MCP Commands Sequence\n\n1. **Create epic:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_create_issue (issue_type: \"Epic\")\n```\n\n2. **Update Work Item Description:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_update_issue with customfield_10363\n```\n\n3. **Create child tasks:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_create_issue with parent: EPIC-KEY\n```\n\n4. **Assign and transition:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_update_issue (assignee)\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_transition_issue (status)\n```\n\n## Keywords\njira, epic, feature, initiative, prowler, large feature\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:13:57.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing structured issue tracking and epic creation for large features and refactoring initiatives.","zh":"适合需要结构化问题跟踪和史诗创建的项目管理代理，用于大型功能和重构项目。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントが大規模な機能とリファクタリングイニシアチブのための構造化された問題追跡とエピック作成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"대규모 기능 및 리팩토링 이니셔티브를 위한 구조화된 이슈 추적 및 에픽 생성이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan un seguimiento de problemas estructurado y la creación de epics para grandes características e iniciativas de refactorización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet ayant besoin d''un suivi de problèmes structuré et de la création d''épics pour de grandes fonctionnalités et des initiatives de refactoring.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die ein strukturiertes Problem-Tracking und die Erstellung von Epics für große Funktionen und Refactoring-Initiativen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de rastreamento de problemas estruturados e criação de épicos para recursos e iniciativas de refatoração em grande escala.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления проектами, которым требуется структурированное отслеживание проблем и создание эпики для крупных функций и инициатив по рефакторингу.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى تتبع مشاكل منظم وتشكيل ملحمة لسمات ومبادرات إعادة الهيكلة كبيرة النطاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive Jira epics with detailed feature overviews, requirements, and Figma design links, streamlining development workflows and enhancing collaboration through markdown-based templates and API + UI + SDK integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建包含详细功能概述、要求和Figma设计链接的全面Jira史诗的能力，通过基于markdown的模板和API + UI + SDK集成来简化开发工作流程并增强协作。","ja":"エージェントが詳細な機能の概要、要件、およびFigmaデザインリンクを含む包括的なJiraエピックを作成できるようにし、MarkdownベースのテンプレートとAPI + UI + SDKの統合を通じて開発ワークフローを簡素化し、コラボレーションを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 자세한 기능 개요, 요구 사항 및 Figma 디자인 링크를 포함한 포괄적인 Jira 에픽을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 마크다운 기반 템플릿과 API + UI + SDK 통합을 통해 개발 워크플ロー를 간소화하고 협업을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear epics de Jira completos con descripciones detalladas de las características, requisitos y enlaces de diseño de Figma, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo y mejorando la colaboración a través de plantillas basadas en markdown y la integración de API + UI + SDK.","fr":"Autonomise les agents à créer des épics Jira complets avec des descriptions détaillées des fonctionnalités, des exigences et des liens de conception Figma, rationalisant les flux de travail de développement et améliorant la collaboration à travers des modèles basés sur markdown et l''intégration d''API + UI + SDK.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Jira-Epics mit detaillierten Funktionsübersichten, Anforderungen und Figma-Design-Links zu erstellen, Entwicklungswerkflüsse zu rationalisieren und die Zusammenarbeit durch markdown-basierte Vorlagen und API- + UI- + SDK-Integration zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar épicos Jira abrangentes com visões gerais detalhadas de recursos, requisitos e links de design do Figma, racionalizando fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento e melhorando a colaboração por meio de modelos baseados em markdown e integração de API + UI + SDK.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние эпики Jira с подробными обзорами функций, требованиями и ссылками на дизайн Figma, оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки и повышая сотрудничество за счет шаблонов на основе markdown и интеграции API + UI + SDK.","ar":"يعزز الوكلاء لإنشاء ملحمة جيرا شاملة مع لمحة عامة مفصلة عن الميزات والمتطلبات وروابط التصميم الفيجما، وتبسيط سير عمل التطوير وتعزيز التعاون من خلال قوالب تستند إلى markdown والدمج API + UI + SDK."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating epics for large-scale application features","Managing major refactoring initiatives across multiple components","Developing new views and pages with integrated API and UI work"],"zh":["为大型应用程序功能创建史诗","跨多个组件管理主要的重构项目","使用集成的API和UI工作开发新的视图和页面"],"ja":["大規模なアプリケーションの機能のためのエピックを作成する","複数のコンポーネントを横断する主要なリファクタリングイニシアチブの管理","統合されたAPIとUIの作業を使用して新しいビューとページを開発する"],"ko":["대규모 애플리케이션 기능을 위한 에픽 생성","다중 구성 요소를横断하는 주요 리팩토링 이니셔티브 관리","통합된 API 및 UI 작업을 사용하여 새로운 뷰 및 페이지 개발"],"es":["Creación de epics para características de aplicaciones a gran escala","Gestión de iniciativas de refactorización importantes en varios componentes","Desarrollo de nuevas vistas y páginas con trabajo de API y UI integrado"],"fr":["Création d''épics pour des fonctionnalités d''applications à grande échelle","Gestion d''initiatives de refactoring importantes sur plusieurs composants","Développement de nouvelles vues et pages avec travail d''API et d''UI intégré"],"de":["Erstellung von Epics für große Anwendungsmerkmale","Verwaltung wichtiger Refactoring-Initiativen über mehrere Komponenten hinweg","Entwicklung neuer Ansichten und Seiten mit integriertem API- und UI-Arbeit"],"pt":["Criar épicos para recursos de aplicativos em grande escala","Gerenciar iniciativas de refatoração principais em vários componentes","Desenvolver novas visualizações e páginas com trabalho de API e UI integrado"],"ru":["Создание эпики для функций крупномасштабных приложений","Управление основными инициативами по рефакторингу на нескольких компонентах","Разработка новых представлений и страниц с интегрированной работой API и UI"],"ar":["إنشاء ملحمة لسمات التطبيقات على نطاق واسع","إدارة مبادرات إعادة الهيكلة الرئيسية عبر مكونات متعددة","تطوير مناظير وصفحات جديدة مع عمل API و UI متكاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira setup and configuration","Limited to epic creation and management within Jira ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Jira设置和配置","仅限于Jira生态系统内的史诗创建和管理"],"ja":["Jiraの設定と構成が必要","Jiraエコシステム内でのエピックの作成と管理のみ"],"ko":["Jira 설정 및 구성이 필요","Jira 생태계 내에서 에픽 생성 및 관리만 가능"],"es":["Requiere configuración y establecimiento de Jira","Limitado a la creación y gestión de epics dentro del ecosistema de Jira"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une mise en place de Jira","Limité à la création et à la gestion d''épics au sein de l''écosystème Jira"],"de":["Benötigt Jira-Setup und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Epics innerhalb des Jira-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Jira","Limitado à criação e gerenciamento de épicos dentro do ecossistema Jira"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Jira","Ограничен созданием и управлением эпики внутри экосистемы Jira"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين جيرا","محدود بالملحمة وخلق الإدارة داخل نظام جيرا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9a7f0c5581310667fb66286558de4bbdeb85b4fe0fbc691d1fc7416793e4eae8","qualityScore":62}');
