tâches"],"de":["Aufgabenorchestrierung für KI-Agenten","Native Git-Integration","Unterstützung für SQLite","Verwendet MCP für die Aufgabenverwaltung","Ermöglicht effiziente Aufgabenkoordinierung"],"pt":["Orquestração de tarefas para ferramentas de IA","Integração nativa com git","Suporte a SQLite","Tarefas automatizadas","Gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Управление задачами для ИИ Агентов","Родная интеграция с git","Поддержка SQLite","Автоматизированные задачи","Управление потоком работы"],"ar":["توجيه المهام للوكلاء الذكيين","التكامل الأصلي مع git","دعم SQLite","مهام آلية","إدارة تدفق العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","任务编排工具","SQLite数据库","native git集成","如何使用overseer-plan","overseer-plan教程","AI代理工具比较","overseer-plan安装","overseer-plan设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","タスクオーケストレーションツール","SQLiteデータベース","ネイティブgit統合","overseer-planの使い方","overseer-planチュートリアル","AIエージェントツール比較","overseer-planのインストール","overseer-planの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","작업 오케스트레이션 도구","SQLite 데이터베이스","네이티브 git 통합","overseer-plan 사용법","overseer-plan 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 도구 비교","overseer-plan 설치","overseer-plan 설정 가이드"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Orquestación de tareas","Integración de git","SQLite","MCP","Cómo utilizar overseer-plan","Alternativas a overseer-plan","Instalación de overseer-plan","Guía de configuración de overseer-plan"],"fr":["Agents d''IA","Orchestration de tâches","Intégration de git","SQLite","MCP","Comment utiliser overseer-plan","Alternatives à overseer-plan","Installation d''overseer-plan","Guide de configuration d''overseer-plan"],"de":["KI-Agenten","Aufgabenorchestrierung","Git-Integration","SQLite","MCP","Wie man overseer-plan verwendet","Alternativen zu overseer-plan","Installation von overseer-plan","Konfigurationsanleitung für overseer-plan"],"pt":["como usar overseer-plan","o que é overseer-plan","ferramentas de IA","orquestração de tarefas","alternative ao Jenkins","guia de instalação do overseer-plan","configuração do overseer-plan","exemplos de uso do overseer-plan"],"ru":["как использовать overseer-plan","что такое overseer-plan","ИИ Агенты","управление задачами","альтернатива Jenkins","руководство по установке overseer-plan","настройка overseer-plan","примеры использования overseer-plan"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام overseer-plan","ما هو overseer-plan","الوكلاء الذكيين","توجيه المهام","بديل ل Jenkins","دليل تثبيت overseer-plan","إعداد overseer-plan","أمثلة على استخدام overseer-plan"]}},"owner":"nsyout","repo":"overseer","repoPath":"nsyout/overseer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.960Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"overseer-plan","description":"Convert markdown planning documents to Overseer tasks via MCP codemode. Use when converting plans, specs, or design docs to trackable task hierarchies.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Converting Markdown Documents to Overseer Tasks\n\nUse `/overseer-plan` to convert any markdown planning document into trackable Overseer tasks.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing a plan in plan mode\n- Converting specs/design docs to implementation tasks\n- Creating tasks from roadmap or milestone documents\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/overseer-plan <markdown-file-path>\n/overseer-plan <file> --priority 1           # Set priority (0-2, 0=highest)\n/overseer-plan <file> --parent <task-id>     # Create as child","body":"# Converting Markdown Documents to Overseer Tasks\n\nUse `/overseer-plan` to convert any markdown planning document into trackable Overseer tasks.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing a plan in plan mode\n- Converting specs/design docs to implementation tasks\n- Creating tasks from roadmap or milestone documents\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/overseer-plan <markdown-file-path>\n/overseer-plan <file> --priority 1           # Set priority (0-2, 0=highest)\n/overseer-plan <file> --parent <task-id>     # Create as child of existing task\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n1. Reads markdown file\n2. Extracts title from first `#` heading (strips \"Plan: \" prefix)\n3. Creates Overseer milestone (or child task if `--parent` provided)\n4. Analyzes structure for child task breakdown\n5. Creates child tasks (depth 1) or subtasks (depth 2) when appropriate\n6. Returns task ID and breakdown summary\n\n## Hierarchy Levels\n\n| Depth | Name | Example |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| 0 | **Milestone** | \"Add user authentication system\" |\n| 1 | **Task** | \"Implement JWT middleware\" |\n| 2 | **Subtask** | \"Add token verification function\" |\n\n## Breakdown Decision\n\n**Create subtasks when:**\n- 3-7 clearly separable work items\n- Implementation across multiple files/components\n- Clear sequential dependencies\n\n**Keep single milestone when:**\n- 1-2 steps only\n- Work items tightly coupled\n- Plan is exploratory/investigative\n\n## Task Quality Criteria\n\nEvery task must be:\n- **Atomic**: Single committable unit of work\n- **Validated**: Has tests OR explicit acceptance criteria in context (\"Done when: ...\")\n- **Clear**: Technical, specific, imperative verb\n\nEvery milestone must:\n- **Demoable**: Produces runnable/testable increment\n- **Builds on prior**: Can depend on previous milestone''s output\n\n## Review Workflow\n\n1. Analyze document → propose breakdown\n2. **Invoke Oracle** to review breakdown and suggest improvements\n3. Incorporate feedback\n4. Create in Overseer (persists to SQLite via MCP)\n\n## After Creating\n\n```javascript\nawait tasks.get(\"<id>\");                    // TaskWithContext (full context + learnings)\nawait tasks.list({ parentId: \"<id>\" });     // Task[] (children without context chain)\nawait tasks.start(\"<id>\");                  // Task (VCS required - creates bookmark, records start commit)\nawait tasks.complete(\"<id>\", { result: \"...\", learnings: [...] });  // Task (VCS required - commits, bubbles learnings)\n```\n\n**VCS Required**: `start` and `complete` require git (fail with `NotARepository` if none found). CRUD operations work without VCS.\n\n**Note**: Priority must be 0-2. Blockers cannot be ancestors or descendants.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- Document incomplete or exploratory\n- Content not actionable\n- No meaningful planning content\n\n---\n\n## Reading Order\n\n| Task | File |\n|------|------|\n| Understanding API | @file references/api.md |\n| Agent implementation | @file references/implementation.md |\n| See examples | @file references/examples.md |\n\n## In This Reference\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `references/api.md` | Overseer MCP codemode API types/methods |\n| `references/implementation.md` | Step-by-step execution instructions for agent |\n| `references/examples.md` | Complete worked examples |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:39.880Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents requiring seamless integration with Markdown documents and native git support via gix.","zh":"适用于需要与 Markdown 文档实现无缝集成以及通过 gix 获得原生 git 支持的任务管理代理。","ja":"Markdown ドキュメントとのシームレスな統合と、gix 経由でのネイティブ git サポートを必要とするタスク管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"Markdown 문서와의 무결점 통합 및 gix를 통한 네이티브 git 지원을 필요로 하는 작업 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que requieren una integración sin problemas con documentos Markdown y soporte git nativo a través de gix.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une intégration transparente avec des documents Markdown et un support git natif via gix.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Markdown-Dokumenten und nativem Git-Support über gix erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que exigem integração sem problemas com documentos Markdown e suporte nativo ao git via gix.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению задачами, требующих бесшовной интеграции с документами Markdown и родной поддержкой git через gix.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المهام الذي يتطلب التكامل السلس مع مستندات Markdown والدعم الأصلي ل git عبر gix."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert Markdown planning documents into trackable Overseer tasks with SQLite-backed storage, enabling efficient task orchestration via MCP and prioritization using flags like --priority and --parent.","zh":"赋予代理将 Markdown 计划文档转换为可跟踪的 Overseer 任务的能力，采用 SQLite 作为后端存储，通过 MCP 实现高效的任务编排，并使用诸如 --priority 和 --parent 的标志进行优先级排序。","ja":"Markdown 計画文書を追跡可能な Overseer タスクに変換するエージェントを可能にし、SQLite をバックエンドストレージとして使用し、MCP 経由で効率的なタスクオーケストレーションを実現し、--priority や --parent などのフラグを使用して優先順位付けを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Markdown 계획 문서를 추적 가능한 Overseer 작업으로 변환할 수 있도록 하며 SQLite를 백엔드 저장소로 사용하여 MCP를 통해 효율적인 작업 오케스트레이션을 가능하게 하고 --priority 및 --parent와 같은 플래그를 사용하여 우선 순위를 지정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir documentos de planificación Markdown en tareas Overseer rastreables con almacenamiento con SQLite, lo que permite una orquestación de tareas eficiente a través de MCP y priorización utilizando indicadores como --priority y --parent.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des documents de planification Markdown en tâches Overseer suivies avec un stockage basé sur SQLite, ce qui permet une orchestration de tâches efficace via MCP et une priorisation en utilisant des indicateurs tels que --priority et --parent.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Markdown-Planungsdokumente in nachverfolgbare Overseer-Aufgaben mit SQLite-gestütztem Speicher zu konvertieren, wodurch eine effiziente Aufgabenorchestrierung über MCP und Priorisierung mithilfe von Flaggen wie --priority und --parent ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter documentos de planejamento Markdown em tarefas rastreáveis do Overseer com armazenamento com suporte ao SQLite, permitindo orquestração de tarefas eficiente via MCP e priorização usando flags como --priority e --parent.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать документы планирования Markdown в отслеживаемые задачи Overseer с хранилищем на основе SQLite, обеспечивая эффективную оркестровку задач через MCP и приоритезацию с использованием флагов типа --priority и --parent.","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحويل مستندات التخطيط Markdown إلى مهام قابلة للتتبع من Overseer مع تخزين مدعوم من SQLite ، مما يتيح إدارة المهام الفعالة عبر MCP وتحديد الأولوية باستخدام أعلام مثل --priority و --parent."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting roadmap documents to actionable Overseer tasks","Creating implementation tasks from specs and design documents","Automating task generation from milestone documents with native git integration"],"zh":["将路线图文档转换为可执行的 Overseer 任务","从规格和设计文档创建实现任务","通过原生 git 集成从里程碑文档自动生成任务"],"ja":["ロードマップ文書を実行可能な Overseer タスクに変換する","仕様および設計文書から実装タスクを作成する","ネイティブ git 統合を使用してマイルストーン文書からタスクを自動生成する"],"ko":["로드맵 문서를 실행 가능한 Overseer 작업으로 변환합니다.","사양 및 설계 문서에서 구현 작업을 생성합니다.","네이티브 git 통합을 사용하여 마일스톤 문서에서 작업을 자동으로 생성합니다."],"es":["Conversión de documentos de hoja de ruta en tareas Overseer realizables","Creación de tareas de implementación a partir de especificaciones y documentos de diseño","Automatización de la generación de tareas a partir de documentos de hitos con integración git nativa"],"fr":["Conversion de documents de feuille de route en tâches Overseer réalisables","Création de tâches d''implémentation à partir de spécifications et de documents de conception","Automatisation de la génération de tâches à partir de documents de jalon avec intégration git native"],"de":["Konvertierung von Roadmap-Dokumenten in ausführbare Overseer-Aufgaben","Erstellung von Implementierungsaufgaben aus Spezifikationen und Design-Dokumenten","Automatisierung der Aufgabengenerierung aus Meilenstein-Dokumenten mit nativer Git-Integration"],"pt":["Conversão de documentos de estrada para tarefas ativas do Overseer","Criação de tarefas de implementação a partir de specs e documentos de design","Automatização da geração de tarefas a partir de documentos de marco com integração nativa do git"],"ru":["Преобразование документов дорожной карты в действенные задачи Overseer","Создание задач реализации из спецификаций и документов дизайна","Автоматизация генерации задач из документов вех с родной интеграцией git"],"ar":["تحويل وثائق الخارطة الطريق إلى مهام قابلة للتنفيذ من Overseer","إنشاء مهام التنفيذ من المواصفات ووثائق التصميم","تأتميم توليد المهام من وثائق المرحلة مع التكامل الأصلي ل git"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Markdown file input","SQLite-backed storage necessary","Native git integration via gix required for version control"],"zh":["需要 Markdown 文件输入","需要 SQLite 后端存储","需要通过 gix 的原生 git 集成以实现版本控制"],"ja":["Markdown ファイル入力を必要とする","SQLite バックエンドストレージを必要とする","バージョン管理のために gix 経由のネイティブ git 統合を必要とする"],"ko":["Markdown 파일 입력이 필요합니다.","SQLite 백엔드 저장소가 필요합니다.","버전 관리를 위해 gix를 통한 네이티브 git 통합이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere entrada de archivo Markdown","Almacenamiento con SQLite es necesario","Se requiere integración git nativa a través de gix para el control de versiones"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de fichier Markdown","Un stockage basé sur SQLite est nécessaire","Une intégration git native via gix est requise pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["Benötigt Markdown-Dateieingabe","SQLite-gestützter Speicher ist erforderlich","Native Git-Integration über gix ist für die Versionskontrolle erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer entrada de arquivo Markdown","Armazenamento com suporte ao SQLite necessário","Integração nativa do git via gix necessária para controle de versão"],"ru":["Требуется ввод файла Markdown","Необходимо хранилище на основе SQLite","Родная интеграция git через gix требуется для контроля версий"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال ملف Markdown","مخزن datos مدعوم من SQLite ضروري","التكامل الأصلي ل git عبر gix مطلوب للتحكم في الإصدارات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"710545cc68abbc60f77b0222a4d1327a15c398a428f36fd8584fa0a394c30a63","qualityScore":62}');
