["Comparaison du code source avec la documentation d''API","Vérification des signatures de fonctions et des types","Vérification de la description de JSDoc","Vérification des propriétés dans properties.ts","Prise en charge des génériques et des paramètres"],"de":["Vergleich von Quellcode mit API-Dokumentation","Überprüfung von FunktionsSignaturen und -typen","Überprüfung der JSDoc-Beschreibung","Überprüfung von Eigenschaften in properties.ts","Unterstützung für Generics und Parameter"],"pt":["Compatibilidade com qualquer estrutura","Verificação de assinaturas de função","Verificação de tipos, incluindo genéricos e parâmetros","Verificação de descrições JSDoc","Suporte à análise de propriedades em properties.ts"],"ru":["Совместимость с любым фреймворком","Проверка подписей функций","Проверка типов, включая обобщения и параметры","Проверка описаний JSDoc","Поддержка анализа свойств в properties.ts"],"ar":["التوافق مع أي إطار","التحقق من التواقيع الدالة","التحقق من الأنواع، بما في ذلك العوامل والمعاملات","التحقق من وصفات JSDoc","دعم تحليل الخصائص في properties.ts"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use repo-website-api-review","repo-website-api-review setup guide","API documentation review best practices","repo-website-api-review alternative","repo-website-api-review vs API documentation tools","repo-website-api-review install","what is repo-website-api-review","repo-website-api-review tutorial","API review process with repo-website-api-review"],"zh":["API 文档审查","repo-website-api-review","AIエージェント","API 文档比较","函数签名验证","类型检查","JSDoc 描述验证"],"ja":["API ドキュメントレビュー","repo-website-api-review","AIエージェント","API ドキュメント比較","関数シグネチャ検証","タイプ確認","JSDoc の説明検証"],"ko":["API 문서 리뷰","repo-website-api-review","AI 에이전트","API 문서 비교","함수 시그니처 검증","타입 확인","JSDoc 설명 검증"],"es":["revisión de API","documentación de API","Herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","revisión sistemática","firmas de funciones","tipos de datos","JSDoc","properties.ts"],"fr":["révision d''API","documentation d''API","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs","révision systématique","signatures de fonctions","types de données","JSDoc","properties.ts"],"de":["API-Überprüfung","API-Dokumentation","KI-Tools für Entwickler","systematische Überprüfung","FunktionsSignaturen","Datentypen","JSDoc","properties.ts"],"pt":["repo-website-api-review","análise de API","documentação de API","revisão de API","ferramentas de API","desenvolvimento de software","análise de código","verificação de tipos"],"ru":["repo-website-api-review","ИИ Агенты","проверка API","документация API","анализ API","инструменты API","разработка программного обеспечения","анализ кода","проверка типов"],"ar":["repo-website-api-review","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","استعراض واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تحليل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","أدوات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل الكود","التحقق من الأنواع"]}},"owner":"open-circle","repo":"formisch","repoPath":"open-circle/formisch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.134Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"repo-website-api-review","description":"Review and verify API documentation routes on the Formisch website. Use when checking documentation accuracy, completeness, and consistency with source code.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Reviewing API Documentation\n\nThis skill provides a systematic approach to reviewing API documentation routes for accuracy and consistency.\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Compare with Source Code\n\nFor each documented API:\n\n1. **Read the source file** completely\n2. **Compare function signatures** - Must match exactly\n3. **Verify types** - Generics, parameters, return types\n4. **Check JSDoc** - Descriptions should match\n\n### Step 2: Check properties.ts\n\nVerify each property:\n\n- [ ] Generic const","body":"# Reviewing API Documentation\n\nThis skill provides a systematic approach to reviewing API documentation routes for accuracy and consistency.\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Compare with Source Code\n\nFor each documented API:\n\n1. **Read the source file** completely\n2. **Compare function signatures** - Must match exactly\n3. **Verify types** - Generics, parameters, return types\n4. **Check JSDoc** - Descriptions should match\n\n### Step 2: Check properties.ts\n\nVerify each property:\n\n- [ ] Generic constraints match source code\n- [ ] Parameter types are accurate\n- [ ] Return type is correct\n- [ ] All `href` links are valid\n- [ ] No unused properties defined\n\n### Step 3: Check index.mdx\n\nVerify content:\n\n- [ ] Front matter is complete (title, description, source, contributors)\n- [ ] Function signature matches source exactly\n- [ ] All generics documented\n- [ ] All parameters documented with correct headings (Parameters vs Properties)\n- [ ] Explanation references specific parameters/properties\n- [ ] Examples are realistic and follow conventions\n- [ ] Related section uses correct framework terminology\n\n### Step 4: Check Menu and Links\n\n- [ ] API listed in menu.md (alphabetical order)\n- [ ] All internal links work\n- [ ] Cross-package links use absolute paths\n- [ ] No broken links to types or functions\n\n## Common Issues to Find\n\n### Signature Mismatches\n\n```typescript\n// Source code\nexport function validate(form: FormStore, config?: Config): void;\n\n// ❌ Documentation shows different signature\nconst result = validate(form); // Missing config, wrong return\n```\n\n### Missing Parameters\n\nDocumentation should include ALL parameters from source:\n\n```mdx\n## Parameters\n\n- `form` <Property {...properties.form} />\n- `config` <Property {...properties.config} /> <!-- Don''t forget optional params -->\n```\n\n### Wrong Headings\n\n| API Type   | Heading         |\n| ---------- | --------------- |\n| Functions  | `## Parameters` |\n| Components | `## Properties` |\n\n### Outdated Examples\n\nExamples must work with current API:\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Old API usage\nconst form = createForm(schema);\n\n// ✅ Current API\nconst form = createForm({ schema });\n```\n\n### Framework Terminology\n\n| Framework | Related Section Heading |\n| --------- | ----------------------- |\n| Solid     | `### Primitives`        |\n| Qwik      | `### Hooks`             |\n| Preact    | `### Hooks`             |\n| Vue       | `### Composables`       |\n| Svelte    | `### Runes`             |\n\n### Type Links\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Wrong - using constraint type name\ngenerics: [{ type: ''custom'', name: ''RequiredPath'' }];\n\n// ✅ Correct - using parameter name\ngenerics: [{ type: ''custom'', name: ''TFieldPath'' }];\n```\n\n### Cross-Package Links\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Wrong - relative across packages\nhref: ''../../../core/api/Schema/'';\n\n// ✅ Correct - absolute path\nhref: ''/core/api/Schema/'';\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n### properties.ts\n\n- [ ] All generics have `modifier: ''extends''`\n- [ ] Custom types have valid `href` links\n- [ ] Property order: `name`, `href`, `generics`\n- [ ] No unused properties\n- [ ] Types match source exactly\n\n### index.mdx\n\n- [ ] Title matches API name exactly (case-sensitive)\n- [ ] Description ends with period\n- [ ] Source path is correct\n- [ ] Function signature code block matches source\n- [ ] Correct heading (Parameters/Properties)\n- [ ] Explanation references specific params/props\n- [ ] Returns section present (unless void or component)\n- [ ] Examples section present (unless component/type)\n- [ ] Related section uses correct framework terminology\n- [ ] No Types in Related section\n\n### Menu Integration\n\n- [ ] API listed in appropriate menu.md\n- [ ] Alphabetical order maintained\n- [ ] Link path matches folder structure\n\n### Link Validation\n\n- [ ] All `href` in properties.ts resolve\n- [ ] ApiList links are valid\n- [ ] Cross-framework links use absolute paths\n- [ ] External links (Valibot) use full URLs\n\n## Review Output Format\n\nDocument issues found:\n\n```markdown\n## Review: createForm\n\n### Issues Found\n\n1. **Signature mismatch** (L15)\n   - Source shows `config: FormConfig<TSchema>`\n   - Docs show `config: Config`\n\n2. **Missing parameter** (Parameters section)\n   - `initialInput` not documented\n\n3. **Broken link** (properties.ts L23)\n   - `href: ''../FormConfig/''` - FormConfig not documented\n\n### Recommendations\n\n- Update properties.ts with correct FormConfig type\n- Add initialInput to Parameters section\n- Create FormConfig type documentation\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:14:26.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing precise API documentation validation and consistency checks.","zh":"非常适合需要精确 API 文档验证和一致性检查的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが正確な API ドキュメントの検証と一貫性のチェックを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 API 문서 검증 및 일관성 확인이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una validación precisa de la documentación de API y comprobaciones de coherencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une validation précise de la documentation de l''API et des vérifications de cohérence.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine präzise API-Dokumentationsvalidierung und Konsistenzprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de validação precisa de documentação de API e verificações de consistência.","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, которым требуются точная проверка документации API и проверки на соответствие.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة لكود بحاجة إلى التحقق الدقيق لتثبيت وثائق API والتحقق من الاتساق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure API documentation accuracy by comparing function signatures, verifying types, and checking JSDoc descriptions, utilizing source code and properties.ts files for validation.","zh":"使代理能够通过比较函数签名、验证类型和检查 JSDoc 描述来确保 API 文档的准确性，利用源代码和 properties.ts 文件进行验证。","ja":"エージェントが関数シグネチャの比較、タイプの検証、JSDoc 説明の確認を使用して API ドキュメントの正確性を保証できるようにし、バリデーションにはソースコードと properties.ts ファイルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 함수 시그니처 비교, 유형 검증 및 JSDoc 설명 확인을 사용하여 API 문서의 정확성을 보장할 수 있도록 하며, 검증에는 소스 코드 및 properties.ts 파일을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar la exactitud de la documentación de la API comparando firmas de función, verificando tipos y comprobando descripciones de JSDoc, utilizando archivos de código fuente y properties.ts para la validación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir l''exactitude de la documentation de l''API en comparant les signatures de fonction, en vérifiant les types et en vérifiant les descriptions JSDoc, en utilisant les fichiers de code source et properties.ts pour la validation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Genauigkeit der API-Dokumentation sicherzustellen, indem sie Funktionsvorlagen vergleichen, Typen überprüfen und JSDoc-Beschreibungen prüfen, wobei Quellcode- und properties.ts-Dateien für die Validierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a precisão da documentação da API comparando assinaturas de função, verificando tipos e verificando descrições JSDoc, utilizando arquivos de código-fonte e properties.ts para validação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить точность документации API путем сравнения сигнатур функций, проверки типов и проверки описаний JSDoc, используя исходный код и файлы properties.ts для проверки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ضمان دقة وثائق API من خلال مقارنة التواقيع الدالة والتحقق من الأنواع والتحقق من وصفات JSDoc، واستخدام الملفات المصدر وملفات properties.ts للتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating API documentation routes for accuracy","Comparing function signatures for consistency","Verifying JSDoc descriptions for clarity"],"zh":["验证 API 文档路由的准确性","比较函数签名的一致性","验证 JSDoc 描述的清晰度"],"ja":["API ドキュメントのルートの正確性を検証する","関数シグネチャのの一貫性を比較する","JSDoc 説明の明瞭性を検証する"],"ko":["API 문서 경로의 정확성을 검증하는こと","함수 시그니처의 일관성을 비교하는 것","JSDoc 설명의 명확성을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Validar las rutas de documentación de la API para la exactitud","Comparar firmas de función para la coherencia","Verificar descripciones de JSDoc para la claridad"],"fr":["Valider les routes de documentation de l''API pour l''exactitude","Comparer les signatures de fonction pour la cohérence","Vérifier les descriptions JSDoc pour la clarté"],"de":["API-Dokumentationsrouten für die Genauigkeit validieren","Funktionsvorlagen für die Konsistenz vergleichen","JSDoc-Beschreibungen für die Klarheit prüfen"],"pt":["Validar rotas de documentação de API para precisão","Comparar assinaturas de função para consistência","Verificar descrições JSDoc para clareza"],"ru":["Проверить маршруты документации API на точность","Сравнить сигнатуры функций на соответствие","Проверить описания JSDoc на ясность"],"ar":["التحقق من طرق وثائق API للدقة","مقارنة التواقيع الدالة للاتساق","التحقق من وصفات JSDoc للوضوح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to source code and API documentation","Limited to JavaScript-based APIs with JSDoc comments"],"zh":["需要访问源代码和 API 文档","仅限于具有 JSDoc 注释的基于 JavaScript 的 API"],"ja":["ソースコードと API ドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","JSDoc コメントを備えた JavaScript ベースの API にのみ限定される"],"ko":["소스 코드 및 API 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","JSDoc 주석이 있는 JavaScript 기반 API에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al código fuente y a la documentación de la API","Limitado a APIs basadas en JavaScript con comentarios JSDoc"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code source et à la documentation de l''API","Limité aux API basées sur JavaScript avec des commentaires JSDoc"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Quellcode und API-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf JavaScript-basierte APIs mit JSDoc-Kommentaren"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código-fonte e documentação de API","Limitado a APIs baseadas em JavaScript com comentários JSDoc"],"ru":["Требует доступа к исходному коду и документации API","Ограничен для API на основе JavaScript с комментариями JSDoc"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الكود المصدري ووثائق API","محدود ل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المستندة إلى جافا سكريبت مع تعليقات JSDoc"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4cc6ac5b570dc2c4981a8fcd52bfb6dde39cad960ca96185655169c14ae0dd3b","qualityScore":62}');
