s web qui utilise Playwright automation","de":"webapp-testing ist ein Tool zum Testen von Webanwendungen, das Playwright-Automatisierung verwendet","pt":"O que é webapp-testing? É uma habilidade de teste e depuração de aplicações web locais","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент webapp-testing? Это habilidade для комплексного тестирования и отладки локальных веб-приложений","ar":"ما هي أداة اختبار التطبيقات الإلكترونية؟ هي مهارة لاختبار وتحسين التطبيقات الإلكترونية المحلية"},"features":{"en":["Test frontend functionality in a real browser using Playwright","Verify UI behavior and interactions with Spring Boot and Spring Cloud","Debug web application issues using Spring Cloud Config and Spring Cloud Gateway","Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging with Playwright","Inspect browser console logs for issues with Spring Boot Actuator","Validate form submissions and user flows with OpenFeign and Resilience4j"],"zh":["使用Playwright自动化测试Web应用","支持Spring Boot和Spring Cloud","提供UI行为和交互的验证","支持捕获屏幕截图和浏览器控制台日志","提供表单提交和用户流的验证","支持响应式设计的检查"],"ja":["Playwrightを使用してWebアプリケーションを自動テスト","Spring BootとSpring Cloudをサポート","UIの動作とインタラクションの検証を提供","スクリーンショットとブラウザのコンソールログの取得をサポート","フォームの提出とユーザーフローの検証を提供","レスポンシブデザインのチェックをサポート"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션을 자동 테스트","Spring Boot와 Spring Cloud를 지원","UI 동작과 상호작용의 검증을 제공","스크린샷과 브라우저 콘솔 로그의 획득을 지원","폼 제출과 사용자 흐름의 검증을 제공","반응형 디자인의 확인을 지원"],"es":["Pruebas de funcionalidad del frontend en un navegador real","Verificación del comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y las interacciones","Depuración de problemas de aplicaciones web","Captura de pantallas para documentación o depuración","Inspección de registros de la consola del navegador","Validación de envíos de formularios y flujos de usuario"],"fr":["Tests de la fonctionnalité du frontend dans un navigateur réel","Vérification du comportement de l''interface utilisateur et des interactions","Débogage des problèmes d''applications web","Capture d''écrans pour la documentation ou le débogage","Inspection des journaux de la console du navigateur","Validation des soumissions de formulaires et des flux d''utilisateur"],"de":["Tests der Frontend-Funktionalität in einem realen Browser","Überprüfung des Verhaltens der Benutzeroberfläche und der Interaktionen","Fehlerbehebung bei Webanwendungsproblemen","Bildschirmaufnahmen für Dokumentation oder Fehlerbehebung","Untersuchung der Browser-Konsole-Protokolle","Validierung von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen"],"pt":["Teste de funcionalidades frontend em um navegador real","Verificação de comportamento e interações de UI","Depuração de problemas de aplicações web","Captura de telas para documentação ou depuração","Inspeção de logs de console do navegador"],"ru":["Тестирование frontend-функций в реальном браузере","Проверка поведения и взаимодействий UI","Отладка проблем веб-приложений","Создание скриншотов для документации или отладки","Просмотр журналов консоли браузера"],"ar":["اختبار الوظائف الأمامية في متصفح حقيقي","التحقق من سلوك وتفاعلات الواجهة","تحسين مشاكل التطبيقات الإلكترونية","التقاط لقطات الشاشة للتوثيق أو التحسين","التحقق من سجلات وحدة التحكم للمتصفح"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use webapp-testing with Spring Boot","webapp-testing vs Selenium","webapp-testing setup guide for Playwright","what is webapp-testing in microservices","webapp-testing alternative to Cypress","webapp-testing install with Spring Cloud","webapp-testing tutorial for beginners","webapp-testing best practices with Redis","webapp-testing and Spring Cloud Loadbalancer","webapp-testing with Vault for security"],"zh":["Web应用程序测试","Playwright自动化","Spring Boot","Spring Cloud","UI测试","自动化测试","Web应用程序调试","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","Playwright自動化","Spring Boot","Spring Cloud","UIテスト","自動テスト","Webアプリケーションデバッグ","AIエージェント"],"ko":["웹애플리케이션 테스트","Playwright 자동화","Spring Boot","Spring Cloud","UI 테스트","자동 테스트","웹애플리케이션 디버깅","AI 도구"],"es":["webapp-testing","pruebas de aplicaciones web","Playwright automation","depuración de aplicaciones web","pruebas de frontend","test de aplicaciones web","herramientas de prueba de aplicaciones web","automatización de pruebas","pruebas de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["webapp-testing","tests d''applications web","Playwright automation","débogage d''applications web","tests de frontend","test d''applications web","outils de test d''applications web","automatisation de tests","tests d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["webapp-testing","Webanwendungstests","Playwright-Automatisierung","Fehlerbehebung bei Webanwendungen","Frontend-Tests","Webanwendungstest","Webanwendungstest-Tools","Testautomatisierung","Benutzeroberflächentests"],"pt":["webapp-testing","playwright","teste de aplicações web","depuração de aplicações web","automação de teste","spring boot","microservices"],"ru":["ИИ Агент webapp-testing","playwright","тестирование веб-приложений","отладка веб-приложений","автоматизация тестирования","spring boot","микросервисы"],"ar":["أداة اختبار التطبيقات الإلكترونية","playwright","اختبار التطبيقات الإلكترونية","تحسين التطبيقات الإلكترونية","أتمتة الاختبار","spring boot","المicroservices"]}},"owner":"piomin","repo":"course-spring-microservices","repoPath":"piomin/course-spring-microservices","stars":156,"forks":67,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T15:52:19Z","topics":["circuit-breaker","consul","eureka","microservices","openfeign","rate-limiting","redis","resilience4j","spring-boot","spring-boot-actuator","spring-cloud","spring-cloud-config","spring-cloud-gateway","spring-cloud-loadbalancer","spring-cloud-netflix","vault","webclient"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisit","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js installed on the system\n- A locally running web application (or accessible URL)\n- Playwright will be installed automatically if not present\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Browser Automation\n- Navigate to URLs\n- Click buttons and links\n- Fill form fields\n- Select dropdowns\n- Handle dialogs and alerts\n\n### 2. Verification\n- Assert element presence\n- Verify text content\n- Check element visibility\n- Validate URLs\n- Test responsive behavior\n\n### 3. Debugging\n- Capture screenshots\n- View console logs\n- Inspect network requests\n- Debug failed tests\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Example 1: Basic Navigation Test\n```javascript\n// Navigate to a page and verify title\nawait page.goto(''http://localhost:3000'');\nconst title = await page.title();\nconsole.log(''Page title:'', title);\n```\n\n### Example 2: Form Interaction\n```javascript\n// Fill out and submit a form\nawait page.fill(''#username'', ''testuser'');\nawait page.fill(''#password'', ''password123'');\nawait page.click(''button[type=\"submit\"]'');\nawait page.waitForURL(''**/dashboard'');\n```\n\n### Example 3: Screenshot Capture\n```javascript\n// Capture a screenshot for debugging\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''debug.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Always verify the app is running** - Check that the local server is accessible before running tests\n2. **Use explicit waits** - Wait for elements or navigation to complete before interacting\n3. **Capture screenshots on failure** - Take screenshots to help debug issues\n4. **Clean up resources** - Always close the browser when done\n5. **Handle timeouts gracefully** - Set reasonable timeouts for slow operations\n6. **Test incrementally** - Start with simple interactions before complex flows\n7. **Use selectors wisely** - Prefer data-testid or role-based selectors over CSS classes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: Wait for Element\n```javascript\nawait page.waitForSelector(''#element-id'', { state: ''visible'' });\n```\n\n### Pattern: Check if Element Exists\n```javascript\nconst exists = await page.locator(''#element-id'').count() > 0;\n```\n\n### Pattern: Get Console Logs\n```javascript\npage.on(''console'', msg => console.log(''Browser log:'', msg.text()));\n```\n\n### Pattern: Handle Errors\n```javascript\ntry {\n  await page.click(''#button'');\n} catch (error) {\n  await page.screenshot({ path: ''error.png'' });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Requires Node.js environment\n- Cannot test native mobile apps (use React Native Testing Library instead)\n- May have issues with complex authentication flows\n- Some modern frameworks may require specific configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:29:40.061Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced web application testing and debugging capabilities with Playwright automation.","zh":"适用于需要高级Web应用程序测试和调试功能的前端代理，特别是使用Playwright自动化。","ja":"Playwright自動化を使用した高度なWebアプリケーションテストおよびデバッグ機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"Playwright 자동화를 사용한 고급 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de prueba y depuración de aplicaciones web con la automatización de Playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent des capacités de test et de débogage d''applications web avancées avec l''automatisation de Playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Webanwendungstest- und -debugging-Funktionen mit Playwright-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de teste e depuração de aplicações web com automação Playwright.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности тестирования и отладки веб-приложений с помощью автоматизации Playwright.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لاختبار وتحليل الأعطال لتطبيقات الويب باستخدام أتمتة Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate frontend functionality testing in real browsers, verify UI behavior, and debug web application issues using Playwright, supporting features like screenshot capture, browser console log inspection, and form submission validation.","zh":"赋予代理自动化前端功能测试的能力，在真实浏览器中验证UI行为，并使用Playwright调试Web应用程序问题，支持功能如截图捕获、浏览器控制台日志检查和表单提交验证。","ja":"エージェントにPlaywrightを使用してフロントエンドの機能テストを自動化し、実際のブラウザでUIの動作を検証し、Webアプリケーションの問題をデバッグする能力を提供します。スクリーンショットのキャプチャ、ブラウザコンソールログの検査、フォーム送信の検証などの機能をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright를 사용하여 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하고 실제 브라우저에서 UI 동작을 검증하며 웹 애플리케이션 문제를 디버깅할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 스크린샷 캡처, 브라우저 콘솔 로그 검사, 폼 제출 검증 등과 같은 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la prueba de funcionalidad frontend en navegadores reales, verificar el comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y depurar problemas de aplicaciones web utilizando Playwright, con características como captura de pantalla, inspección de registros de consola del navegador y validación de envío de formularios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité frontend dans des navigateurs réels, de vérifier le comportement de l''interface utilisateur et de déboguer les problèmes d''applications web en utilisant Playwright, avec des fonctionnalités comme la capture d''écran, l''inspection des journaux de console du navigateur et la validation de l''envoi de formulaires.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Funktionalität von Frontend-Tests in realen Browsern zu automatisieren, das Verhalten der Benutzeroberfläche zu überprüfen und Probleme mit Webanwendungen mithilfe von Playwright zu debuggen, mit Funktionen wie Screenshot-Erfassung, Browser-Konsole-Log-Inspektion und Formular-Übermittlungsvalidierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend em navegadores reais, verificar o comportamento da UI e depurar problemas de aplicativos web usando Playwright, com recursos como captura de tela, inspeção de logs de console do navegador e validação de envio de formulários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование функциональности фронтенда в реальных браузерах, проверять поведение UI и отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений с помощью Playwright, поддерживая функции такие как захват экрана, осмотр журнала консоли браузера и проверка отправки форм.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير إمكانية أتمتة اختبار الوظائف الأمامية في المتصفحات الفعلية، والتحقق من سلوك الواجهة وتصحيح أعطال تطبيقات الويب باستخدام Playwright، مع دعم لميزات مثل التقاط الشاشة، وفحص سجل محددات المتصفح، وتصحيح صحة إرسال النماذج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend functionality tests in real browsers","Debugging web application issues using Playwright automation","Validating responsive design across different viewports","Verifying UI behavior and interactions","Capturing screenshots for documentation or debugging purposes"],"zh":["在真实浏览器中自动化前端功能测试","使用Playwright自动化调试Web应用程序问题","在不同视口中验证响应式设计","验证UI行为和交互","捕获截图用于文档或调试目的"],"ja":["実際のブラウザでフロントエンドの機能テストを自動化する","Playwright自動化を使用してWebアプリケーションの問題をデバッグする","さまざまなビューポートでレスポンシブデザインを検証する","UIの動作とインタラクションを検証する","ドキュメントまたはデバッグ目的のスクリーンショットをキャプチャする"],"ko":["실제 브라우저에서 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하는 것","Playwright 자동화를 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션 문제를 디버깅하는 것","다양한 뷰포트에서 반응형 디자인을 검증하는 것","UI 동작과 상호작용을 검증하는 것","문서 또는 디버깅 목적으로 스크린샷을 캡처하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de funcionalidad frontend en navegadores reales","Depurar problemas de aplicaciones web utilizando la automatización de Playwright","Validar diseño receptivo en diferentes puntos de vista","Verificar el comportamiento y las interacciones de la interfaz de usuario","Capturar pantallas para documentación o fines de depuración"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité frontend dans des navigateurs réels","Déboguer les problèmes d''applications web en utilisant l''automatisation de Playwright","Valider la conception réactive sur différents points de vue","Vérifier le comportement et les interactions de l''interface utilisateur","Capturer des écrans pour la documentation ou les fins de débogage"],"de":["Automatisieren von Frontend-Funktionalitätstests in realen Browsern","Debuggen von Webanwendungsproblemen mithilfe der Playwright-Automatisierung","Validieren von responsivem Design in verschiedenen Ansichten","Überprüfen des Benutzeroberflächenverhaltens und der Interaktionen","Erfassen von Screenshots für Dokumentations- oder Debuggingzwecke"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend em navegadores reais","Depurar problemas de aplicativos web usando automação Playwright","Validar design responsivo em diferentes pontos de vista","Verificar comportamento da UI e interações","Capturar telas para documentação ou fins de depuração"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование функциональности фронтенда в реальных браузерах","Отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений с помощью автоматизации Playwright","Проверять адаптивный дизайн на разных видах","Проверять поведение UI и взаимодействия","Сделать снимки экрана для документации или целей отладки"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار الوظائف الأمامية في المتصفحات الفعلية","تصحيح أعطال تطبيقات الويب باستخدام أتمتة Playwright","التحقق من التصميم المرن عبر عدة نقاط عرض","التحقق من سلوك الواجهة والتفاعلات","التقاط الشاشة لدوافع التوثيق أو تصحيح الأعطال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright automation setup","Limited to local web application testing","Needs real browser environment for testing"],"zh":["需要Playwright自动化设置","仅限本地Web应用程序测试","需要真实浏览器环境进行测试"],"ja":["Playwright自動化の設定が必要","ローカルのWebアプリケーションテストのみ","テストには実際のブラウザ環境が必要"],"ko":["Playwright 자동화 설정이 필요함","로컬 웹 애플리케이션 테스트에만 국한됨","테스트를 위해 실제 브라우저 환경이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de automatización de Playwright","Limitado a pruebas de aplicaciones web locales","Necesita un entorno de navegador real para pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''automatisation de Playwright","Limité aux tests d''applications web locales","Nécessite un environnement de navigateur réel pour les tests"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Automatisierungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungstests","Benötigt eine reale Browserumgebung für Tests"],"pt":["Requer configuração de automação Playwright","Limitado a testes de aplicações web locais","Necessita de ambiente de navegador real para testes"],"ru":["Требует настройки автоматизации Playwright","Ограничен тестированием веб-приложений на локальном уровне","Требует реальной среды браузера для тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد أتمتة Playwright","محدود باختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية","يحتاج إلى بيئة متصفح حقيقية للاختبار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"31e301853c09c350e8a55e8e078a1f6e5873f3cdda6cd05a46ddd3d1f0ab6c61","qualityScore":61}');
