tion":{"en":"langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration is a setup for configuring vector stores in LangChain4J, used for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications and semantic search in Java.","zh":"LangChain4J 向量存储配置是一种用于配置向量存储的方法，用于 Retrieval-Augmented Generation 应用","ja":"LangChain4J ベクトルストア設定は、ベクトルストアを設定するための方法であり、セマンティック検索や多模態埋め込みを実現する","ko":"LangChain4J 벡터 스토어 설정은 벡터 스토어를 설정하기 위한 방법으로 Retrieval-Augmented Generation 애플리케이션을 구축","es":"La configuración de almacenamiento de vectores LangChain4J es una función que permite a los desarrolladores configurar almacenamiento de vectores para aplicaciones de generación mejorada.","fr":"La configuration des magasins de vecteurs LangChain4J est une fonctionnalité qui permet aux développeurs de configurer les magasins de vecteurs pour les applications de génération améliorée.","de":"Die Konfiguration des Vektorspeichers LangChain4J ist eine Funktion, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Vektorspeicher für Retrieval-Augmented Generation-Anwendungen zu konfigurieren.","pt":"Configuração de lojas de vetores LangChain4J é um recurso para armazenar e recuperar embeddings em aplicações de Geração-Aumentada de Recuperação.","ru":"Настройка хранилищ векторов LangChain4J - это функция для хранения и извлечения вложений в приложениях Retrieval-Augmented Generation.","ar":"تكوين مخازن المتجهات LangChain4J هو ميزة لتخزين واسترجاع التضمينات في تطبيقات الجيل المعزز بالاسترجاع."},"features":{"en":["Configures vector stores for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications","Supports embedding storage and retrieval for RAG apps","Enables semantic search in Java applications","Integrates LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses","Configures multi-modal embedding storage for text, images, or other data","Sets up hybrid search combining vector similarity and traditional search"],"zh":["支持多模态埋め込み存储","实现语义搜索和 Retrieval-Augmented Generation","配置向量数据库以实现上下文感知响应","支持混合搜索和向量相似度计算","用于 Java 应用程序的向量存储配置"],"ja":["多模態埋め込みストレージをサポート","セマンティック検索と Retrieval-Augmented Generation を実現","ベクトルデータベースを設定してコンテキスト感知レスポンスを実現","ハイブリッド検索とベクトル類似度計算をサポート","Java アプリケーションのベクトルストア設定"],"ko":["다중 모드埋め込み 저장소 지원","의미 검색 및 Retrieval-Augmented Generation 구현","벡터 데이터베이스 설정을 통해 컨텍스트 인식 응답 구현","하이브리드 검색 및 벡터 유사도 계산 지원","자바 애플리케이션의 벡터 스토어 설정"],"es":["Configuración de almacenamiento de vectores para aplicaciones de generación mejorada","Mejora de la búsqueda semántica en aplicaciones Java","Integración de LLMs con bases de datos de vectores para respuestas contextualizadas","Configuración de almacenamiento de vectores multimodales para texto, imágenes y otros datos","Configuración de búsqueda híbrida que combina similitud de vectores"],"fr":["Configuration des magasins de vecteurs pour les applications de génération améliorée","Amélioration de la recherche sémantique dans les applications Java","Intégration des LLM avec les bases de données de vecteurs pour des réponses contextualisées","Configuration du stockage de vecteurs multimodaux pour le texte, les images et d''autres données","Configuration de la recherche hybride qui combine la similarité de vecteurs"],"de":["Konfiguration von Vektorspeichern für Retrieval-Augmented Generation-Anwendungen","Verbesserung der semantischen Suche in Java-Anwendungen","Integration von LLMs mit Vektordatenbanken für kontextabhängige Antworten","Konfiguration von multimodalem Vektorspeicher für Text, Bilder und andere Daten","Konfiguration von hybrider Suche, die Vektorsimilarität kombiniert"],"pt":["Armazenamento de embeddings para aplicações de Geração-Aumentada de Recuperação","Implementação de busca semântica em aplicações Java","Integração com LLMs para respostas contextuais","Configuração de armazenamento de embeddings multi-modais para texto, imagens e outros dados","Combinação de busca híbrida para resultados mais precisos"],"ru":["Хранение вложений для приложений Retrieval-Augmented Generation","Реализация семантического поиска в приложениях Java","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами для контекстуальных ответов","Настройка хранилищ вложений для нескольких модальных данных","Комбинация гибридного поиска для более точных результатов"],"ar":["تخزين التضمينات لتطبيقات الجيل المعزز بالاسترجاع","تنفيذ البحث الدلالي في تطبيقات Java","تكامل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للاستجابات السياقية","تكوين مخازن التضمينات المتعددة الأشكال للنصوص والصور والبيانات الأخرى","مزيج من البحث الهجين للحصول على نتائج أكثر دقة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration","langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration setup guide","langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration alternative","langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration vs faiss","langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration install","configuring vector stores for RAG apps","semantic search in Java with LangChain4J","LLM integration with vector databases"],"zh":["LangChain4J 向量存储配置","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","语义搜索","多模态埋め込み","向量数据库","Java 应用程序","AI 工具","向量存储配置"],"ja":["LangChain4J ベクトルストア設定","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","セマンティック検索","多模態埋め込み","ベクトルデータベース","Java アプリケーション","AI エージェント","ベクトルストア設定"],"ko":["LangChain4J 벡터 스토어 설정","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","의미 검색","다중 모드埋め込み","벡터 데이터베이스","자바 애플리케이션","AI 도구","벡터 스토어 설정"],"es":["LangChain4J","almacenamiento de vectores","generación mejorada","búsqueda semántica","LLMs","inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","herramientas de AI","Agente de IA"],"fr":["LangChain4J","magasins de vecteurs","génération améliorée","recherche sémantique","LLM","intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","outils d''IA","Agent d''IA"],"de":["LangChain4J","Vektorspeicher","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","semantische Suche","LLM","künstliche Intelligenz","Softwareentwicklung","KI-Tools","KI-Agent"],"pt":["LangChain4J","lojas de vetores","Geração-Aumentada de Recuperação","busca semântica","integração com LLMs","armazenamento de embeddings","aplicações Java","Recuperação de informações"],"ru":["LangChain4J","хранилища векторов","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","семантический поиск","интеграция с ИИ Агентами","хранение вложений","приложения Java","Поиск информации"],"ar":["LangChain4J","مخازن المتجهات","الجيل المعزز بالاسترجاع","البحث الدلالي","تكامل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تخزين التضمينات","تطبيقات Java","استرجاع المعلومات"]}},"owner":"rcrock1978","repo":"Claude-RAG-Chatbot","repoPath":"rcrock1978/Claude-RAG-Chatbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration","description":"Configure LangChain4J vector stores for RAG applications. Use when building semantic search, integrating vector databases (PostgreSQL/pgvector, Pinecone, MongoDB, Milvus, Neo4j), implementing embedding storage/retrieval, setting up hybrid search, or optimizing vector database performance for production AI applications.","version":"1.1.0","tags":["langchain4j","vector-stores","embeddings","rag","semantic-search","ai","llm","java","databases"],"bodyPreview":"# LangChain4J Vector Stores Configuration\n\nConfigure vector stores for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications with LangChain4J.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTo configure vector stores when:\n\n- Building RAG applications requiring embedding storage and retrieval\n- Implementing semantic search in Java applications\n- Integrating LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses\n- Configuring multi-modal embedding storage for text, images, or other data\n- Setting up hybrid search combining vector simil","body":"# LangChain4J Vector Stores Configuration\n\nConfigure vector stores for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications with LangChain4J.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTo configure vector stores when:\n\n- Building RAG applications requiring embedding storage and retrieval\n- Implementing semantic search in Java applications\n- Integrating LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses\n- Configuring multi-modal embedding storage for text, images, or other data\n- Setting up hybrid search combining vector similarity and full-text search\n- Migrating between different vector store providers\n- Optimizing vector database performance for production workloads\n- Building AI-powered applications with memory and persistence\n- Implementing document chunking and embedding pipelines\n- Creating recommendation systems based on vector similarity\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Set Up Basic Vector Store\n\nConfigure an embedding store for vector operations:\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore() {\n    return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n        .host(\"localhost\")\n        .port(5432)\n        .database(\"vectordb\")\n        .user(\"username\")\n        .password(\"password\")\n        .table(\"embeddings\")\n        .dimension(1536) // OpenAI embedding dimension\n        .createTable(true)\n        .useIndex(true)\n        .build();\n}\n```\n\n### Configure Multiple Vector Stores\n\nUse different stores for different use cases:\n\n```java\n@Configuration\npublic class MultiVectorStoreConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    @Qualifier(\"documentsStore\")\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> documentsEmbeddingStore() {\n        return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .table(\"document_embeddings\")\n            .dimension(1536)\n            .build();\n    }\n\n    @Bean\n    @Qualifier(\"chatHistoryStore\")\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> chatHistoryEmbeddingStore() {\n        return MongoDbEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .collectionName(\"chat_embeddings\")\n            .build();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Implement Document Ingestion\n\nUse EmbeddingStoreIngestor for automated document processing:\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic EmbeddingStoreIngestor embeddingStoreIngestor(\n        EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore,\n        EmbeddingModel embeddingModel) {\n\n    return EmbeddingStoreIngestor.builder()\n        .documentSplitter(DocumentSplitters.recursive(\n            300,  // maxSegmentSizeInTokens\n            20,   // maxOverlapSizeInTokens\n            new OpenAiTokenizer(GPT_3_5_TURBO)\n        ))\n        .embeddingModel(embeddingModel)\n        .embeddingStore(embeddingStore)\n        .build();\n}\n```\n\n### Set Up Metadata Filtering\n\nConfigure metadata-based filtering capabilities:\n\n```java\n// MongoDB with metadata field mapping\nIndexMapping indexMapping = IndexMapping.builder()\n    .dimension(1536)\n    .metadataFieldNames(Set.of(\"category\", \"source\", \"created_date\", \"author\"))\n    .build();\n\n// Search with metadata filters\nEmbeddingSearchRequest request = EmbeddingSearchRequest.builder()\n    .queryEmbedding(queryEmbedding)\n    .maxResults(10)\n    .filter(and(\n        metadataKey(\"category\").isEqualTo(\"technical_docs\"),\n        metadataKey(\"created_date\").isGreaterThan(LocalDate.now().minusMonths(6))\n    ))\n    .build();\n```\n\n### Configure Production Settings\n\nImplement connection pooling and monitoring:\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> optimizedPgVectorStore() {\n    HikariConfig hikariConfig = new HikariConfig();\n    hikariConfig.setJdbcUrl(\"jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/vectordb\");\n    hikariConfig.setUsername(\"username\");\n    hikariConfig.setPassword(\"password\");\n    hikariConfig.setMaximumPoolSize(20);\n    hikariConfig.setMinimumIdle(5);\n    hikariConfig.setConnectionTimeout(30000);\n\n    DataSource dataSource = new HikariDataSource(hikariConfig);\n\n    return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n        .dataSource(dataSource)\n        .table(\"embeddings\")\n        .dimension(1536)\n        .useIndex(true)\n        .build();\n}\n```\n\n### Implement Health Checks\n\nMonitor vector store connectivity:\n\n```java\n@Component\npublic class VectorStoreHealthIndicator implements HealthIndicator {\n\n    private final EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore;\n\n    @Override\n    public Health health() {\n        try {\n            embeddingStore.search(EmbeddingSearchRequest.builder()\n                .queryEmbedding(new Embedding(Collections.nCopies(1536, 0.0f)))\n                .maxResults(1)\n                .build());\n\n            return Health.up()\n                .withDetail(\"store\", embeddingStore.getClass().getSimpleName())\n                .build();\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            return Health.down()\n                .withDetail(\"error\", e.getMessage())\n                .build();\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Basic RAG Application Setup\n\n```java\n@Configuration\npublic class SimpleRagConfig {\n\n    @Bean\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore() {\n        return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .host(\"localhost\")\n            .database(\"rag_db\")\n            .table(\"documents\")\n            .dimension(1536)\n            .build();\n    }\n\n    @Bean\n    public ChatLanguageModel chatModel() {\n        return OpenAiChatModel.withApiKey(System.getenv(\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Semantic Search Service\n\n```java\n@Service\npublic class SemanticSearchService {\n\n    private final EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> store;\n    private final EmbeddingModel embeddingModel;\n\n    public List<String> search(String query, int maxResults) {\n        Embedding queryEmbedding = embeddingModel.embed(query).content();\n\n        EmbeddingSearchRequest request = EmbeddingSearchRequest.builder()\n            .queryEmbedding(queryEmbedding)\n            .maxResults(maxResults)\n            .minScore(0.75)\n            .build();\n\n        return store.search(request).matches().stream()\n            .map(match -> match.embedded().text())\n            .toList();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Production Setup with Monitoring\n\n```java\n@Configuration\npublic class ProductionVectorStoreConfig {\n\n    @Bean\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> vectorStore(\n            @Value(\"${vector.store.host}\") String host,\n            MeterRegistry meterRegistry) {\n\n        EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> store = PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .host(host)\n            .database(\"production_vectors\")\n            .useIndex(true)\n            .indexListSize(200)\n            .build();\n\n        return new MonitoredEmbeddingStore<>(store, meterRegistry);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Choose the Right Vector Store\n\n**For Development:**\n- Use `InMemoryEmbeddingStore` for local development and testing\n- Fast setup, no external dependencies\n- Data lost on application restart\n\n**For Production:**\n- **PostgreSQL + pgvector**: Excellent for existing PostgreSQL environments\n- **Pinecone**: Managed service, good for rapid prototyping\n- **MongoDB Atlas**: Good integration with existing MongoDB applications\n- **Milvus/Zilliz**: High performance for large-scale deployments\n\n### Configure Appropriate Index Types\n\nChoose index types based on performance requirements:\n\n```java\n// For high recall requirements\n.indexType(IndexType.FLAT)  // Exact search, slower but accurate\n\n// For balanced performance\n.indexType(IndexType.IVF_FLAT)  // Good balance of speed and accuracy\n\n// For high-speed approximate search\n.indexType(IndexType.HNSW)  // Fastest, slightly less accurate\n```\n\n### Optimize Vector Dimensions\n\nMatch embedding dimensions to your model:\n\n```java\n// OpenAI text-embedding-3-small\n.dimension(1536)\n\n// OpenAI text-embedding-3-large\n.dimension(3072)\n\n// Sentence Transformers\n.dimension(384)  // all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n.dimension(768)  // all-mpnet-base-v2\n```\n\n### Implement Batch Operations\n\nUse batch operations for better performance:\n\n```java\n@Service\npublic class BatchEmbeddingService {\n\n    private static final int BATCH_SIZE = 100;\n\n    public void addDocumentsBatch(List<Document> documents) {\n        for (List<Document> batch : Lists.partition(documents, BATCH_SIZE)) {\n            List<TextSegment> segments = batch.stream()\n                .map(doc -> TextSegment.from(doc.text(), doc.metadata()))\n                .collect(Collectors.toList());\n\n            List<Embedding> embeddings = embeddingModel.embedAll(segments)\n                .content();\n\n            embeddingStore.addAll(embeddings, segments);\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Secure Configuration\n\nProtect sensitive configuration:\n\n```java\n// Use environment variables\n@Value(\"${vector.store.api.key:#{null}}\")\nprivate String apiKey;\n\n// Validate configuration\n@PostConstruct\npublic void validateConfiguration() {\n    if (StringUtils.isBlank(apiKey)) {\n        throw new IllegalStateException(\"Vector store API key must be configured\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## References\n\nFor comprehensive documentation and advanced configurations, see:\n\n- [API Reference](references/api-reference.md) - Complete API documentation\n- [Examples](references/examples.md) - Production-ready examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:07.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Java-based RAG Agents requiring semantic search and multi-modal embedding storage.","zh":"适用于需要语义搜索和多模态嵌入存储的基于Java的RAG Agents。","ja":"JavaベースのRAGエージェントが语义検索とマルチモーダル埋め込みストレージを必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"자바 기반의 RAG 에이전트에서 의미 검색 및 멀티모달 임베딩 저장이 필요한 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes RAG basados en Java que requieren búsqueda semántica y almacenamiento de incrustaciones multi-modales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents RAG basés sur Java nécessitant une recherche sémantique et un stockage d''incrustations multi-modales.","de":"Ideal für Java-basierte RAG-Agents, die semantische Suche und multi-modale Einbettungsspeicherung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes RAG baseados em Java que exigem busca semântica e armazenamento de incorporação multi-modal.","ru":"Идеален для агентов RAG на основе Java, требующих семантического поиска и хранения многомодальной вложенности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل RAG المستند إلى Java الذي يتطلب البحث الدلالي وتخزين التضمين متعدد الوسائط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables seamless integration with vector databases for embedding storage and retrieval, supporting semantic search, LLM context enhancement, and hybrid search configurations directly within Java applications.","zh":"实现与向量数据库的无缝集成，以存储和检索嵌入，支持语义搜索、LLM上下文增强和混合搜索配置，直接在Java应用程序中使用。","ja":"ベクトルデータベースとのシームレスな統合を可能にし、埋め込みの保存と取得をサポートし、语义検索、LLMコンテキストの強化、ハイブリッド検索構成を直接Javaアプリケーション内でサポート。","ko":"벡터 데이터베이스와의無縫な統合을 가능하게 하여 임베딩 저장 및 검색을 지원하며, 의미 검색, LLM 컨텍스트 강화, 하이브리드 검색 구성 등을 자바 애플리케이션内에서 직접 지원합니다.","es":"Permite una integración sin problemas con bases de datos vectoriales para el almacenamiento y recuperación de incrustaciones, admitiendo la búsqueda semántica, la mejora del contexto de LLM y las configuraciones de búsqueda híbrida directamente dentro de las aplicaciones de Java.","fr":"Permet une intégration transparente avec les bases de données vectorielles pour le stockage et la récupération d''incrustations, prenant en charge la recherche sémantique, l''amélioration du contexte de LLM et les configurations de recherche hybride directement au sein des applications Java.","de":"Ermöglicht eine nahtlose Integration mit Vektor-Datenbanken für die Speicherung und Abrufung von Einbettungen, mit Unterstützung für semantische Suche, LLM-Kontextverbesserung und hybride Suchkonfigurationen direkt innerhalb von Java-Anwendungen.","pt":"Permite integração perfeita com bancos de dados de vetores para armazenamento e recuperação de incorporações, suportando busca semântica, melhoria de contexto LLM e configurações de pesquisa híbrida diretamente em aplicativos Java.","ru":"Позволяет обеспечить бесшовную интеграцию с векторными базами данных для хранения и извлечения вложений, поддерживая семантический поиск, улучшение контекста LLM и гибридные конфигурации поиска直接 в приложениях Java.","ar":"يسمح بالتكامل السلس مع قواعد بيانات المتجهات لتخزين واسترجاع التضمين ، ودعم البحث الدلالي وتحسين سياق LLM وتكوينات البحث الهجين مباشرة في تطبيقات Java."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing semantic search in Java RAG applications","Configuring multi-modal embedding storage for text and images","Setting up hybrid search combining vector similarity with traditional methods","Integrating LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses"],"zh":["在Java RAG应用程序中实现语义搜索","为文本和图像配置多模态嵌入存储","设置混合搜索以结合向量相似性和传统方法","将LLM与向量数据库集成以实现上下文感知响应"],"ja":["Java RAGアプリケーションで语义検索を実装する","テキストと画像のマルチモーダル埋め込みストレージを構成する","ベクトル類似性と伝統的な方法を組み合わせたハイブリッド検索を設定する","LLMをベクトルデータベースと統合してコンテキストアウェアなレスポンスを実現する"],"ko":["자바 RAG 애플리케이션에서 의미 검색을 구현하는 것","텍스트 및 이미지에 대한 멀티모달 임베딩 저장을 구성하는 것","벡터 유사성과 전통적인 방법을 결합한 하이브리드 검색을 설정하는 것","LLM을 벡터 데이터베이스와 통합하여 컨텍스트 인식 응답을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Implementar la búsqueda semántica en aplicaciones RAG de Java","Configurar el almacenamiento de incrustaciones multi-modales para texto e imágenes","Configurar la búsqueda híbrida que combina la similitud de vectores con métodos tradicionales","Integrar LLM con bases de datos vectoriales para respuestas con conciencia de contexto"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la recherche sémantique dans les applications RAG Java","Configurer le stockage d''incrustations multi-modales pour le texte et les images","Configurer la recherche hybride combinant la similitude de vecteurs avec des méthodes traditionnelles","Intégrer les LLM avec les bases de données vectorielles pour des réponses sensibles au contexte"],"de":["Implementierung der semantischen Suche in Java-RAG-Anwendungen","Konfiguration des Speichers für multi-modale Einbettungen für Text und Bilder","Einrichtung der hybriden Suche, die Vektorsimilität mit herkömmlichen Methoden kombiniert","Integration von LLM mit Vektor-Datenbanken für kontextbewusste Antworten"],"pt":["Implementação de busca semântica em aplicativos RAG Java","Configuração de armazenamento de incorporação multi-modal para texto e imagens","Configuração de busca híbrida que combina semelhança de vetor com métodos tradicionais","Integração de LLMs com bancos de dados de vetores para respostas sensíveis ao contexto"],"ru":["Реализация семантического поиска в приложениях RAG Java","Настройка хранения многомодальной вложенности для текста и изображений","Настройка гибридного поиска, сочетающего подобие векторов с традиционными методами","Интеграция LLM с векторными базами данных для контекстно-зависимых ответов"],"ar":["تنفيذ البحث الدلالي في تطبيقات RAG Java","تكوين تخزين التضمين متعدد الوسائط للنص والصور","تكوين البحث الهجين الذي يجمع بين تشابه المتجه مع الطرق التقليدية","تكامل LLM مع قواعد بيانات المتجهات لاستجابات حساسة للسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Java-specific implementation (LangChain4J)","Requires compatible vector database backend","Needs embedding model configuration"],"zh":["Java特定实现（LangChain4J）","需要兼容的向量数据库后端","需要嵌入模型配置"],"ja":["Java専用の実装（LangChain4J）","互換性のあるベクトルデータベースバックエンドが必要","埋め込みモデル構成が必要"],"ko":["자바 전용 구현（LangChain4J）","호환 가능한 벡터 데이터베이스 백엔드가 필요함","임베딩 모델 구성이 필요함"],"es":["Implementación específica de Java (LangChain4J)","Requiere un backend de base de datos vectorial compatible","Necesita configuración del modelo de incrustación"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre spécifique à Java (LangChain4J)","Nécessite un backend de base de données vectoriel compatible","Nécessite une configuration du modèle d''incrustation"],"de":["Java-spezifische Implementierung (LangChain4J)","Benötigt kompatiblen Vektor-Datenbank-Backend","Benötigt Einbettungsmodellkonfiguration"],"pt":["Implementação específica do Java (LangChain4J)","Exige backend de banco de dados de vetores compatível","Necessita de configuração do modelo de incorporação"],"ru":["Реализация специфичная для Java (LangChain4J)","Требует совместимого бэкенда векторной базы данных","Требует конфигурации модели вложения"],"ar":["تنفيذ محدد لجافا (LangChain4J)","يتطلب خلفية قاعدة بيانات متجهات متوافقة","يحتاج إلى تكوين نموذج التضمين"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"31eff50e474880b5917bf5f2dcc44afcfc453d97121889eb7211e1b71ea344c7","qualityScore":61}');
