INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('zhuangbiaowei/smart_bot/miles-rl-training', 'miles-rl-training', 'zhuangbiaowei', 'smart_bot', 'community', 'miles-rl-training zhuangbiaowei smart_bot community miles-rl-training is a high-performance RL framework for large-scale model post-training, addressing challenges in MoE training stability and quantization. It benefits developers and researchers working with large-scale models. miles-rl-training 是一个高性能的企业级 RL 框架，适用于大规模模型的训练和优化 miles-rl-training は、大規模モデルを訓練するための高性能なエンタープライズレベルの RL フレームワークです miles-rl-training은 대규모 모델을 학습하고 최적화하기 위한 고성능 엔터프라이즈급 RL 프레임워크입니다 miles-rl-training es un marco de aprendizaje automático de alto rendimiento para el entrenamiento de modelos de gran escala. Ofrece funcionalidades como cuantización y entrenamiento en baja precisión miles-rl-training est un cadre d''apprentissage automatique à haute performance pour l''entraînement de modèles à grande échelle. Il propose des fonctionnalités telles que la quantification et l''entraînement à basse précision miles-rl-training ist ein Hochleistungs-Machine-Learning-Framework für das Training von Modellen in großem Maßstab. Es bietet Funktionen wie Quantisierung und Niedrigpräzisions-Training O miles-rl-training é um framework de treinamento de modelos de grande escala com suporte a FP8 ou INT4 quantization-aware e alinhamento de treinamento e inferência miles-rl-training - это фреймворк для обучения моделей ИИ с поддержкой FP8 или INT4 квантования и совместимости тренировки и вывода مiles-rl-training هو إطار عمل لتدريب نماذج ذكية ذات مقياس كبير مع دقة FP8 أو INT4 وتناسق بين التدريب والاستدلال how to use miles-rl-training miles-rl-training alternative miles-rl-training setup guide what is miles-rl-training miles-rl-training vs slime miles-rl-training install large-scale model training MoE training stability FP8 quantization-aware training miles-rl-training 大规模模型训练 RL 框架 企业级 RL MoE 模型 量化感知训练 高性能训练 AI 工具 机器学习框架 Supports training 1TB+ MoE models like DeepSeek V3 and Qwen3-MoE Enables FP8 or INT4 quantization-aware training for efficient model optimization Ensures bit-wise identical train-infer alignment for consistent model performance Addresses critical challenges in MoE training stability Optimized for large-scale model post-training miles-rl-training is a production-ready RL framework optimized for large-scale model post-training, supporting features like FP8 quantization-aware training and train-inference alignment.');
