INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('pjt222/development-guides/practice-viriditas', 'practice-viriditas', 'pjt222', 'development-guides', 'community', 'practice-viriditas pjt222 development-guides community The practice-viriditas skill provides comprehensive development guides for WSL-Windows environments with Claude Code integration, benefiting developers who want to enhance their coding skills. It offers a unique approach to meditation and philosophical contemplation. practice-viriditas 提供 WSL-Windows 环境的综合开发指南，包括 Claude Code 集成 practice-viriditas は、WSL-Windows 環境の Claude Code 統合を含む包括的な開発ガイドを提供します practice-viriditas는 WSL-Windows 개발 환경 및 Claude Code 통합을 위한 종합 개발 가이드를 제공합니다 Practice-viriditas ofrece guías de desarrollo integrales para entornos WSL-Windows con integración de Claude Code Practice-viriditas propose des guides de développement complets pour les environnements WSL-Windows avec intégration de Claude Code Practice-viriditas bietet umfassende Entwicklungshandbücher für WSL-Windows-Umgebungen mit Claude Code-Integration O practice-viriditas é um guia de desenvolvimento abrangente para ambientes WSL-Windows com integração do Claude Code Practice-viriditas - это комплексное руководство по разработке для WSL-Windows с интеграцией Claude Code practice-viriditas هو دليل تنمية شامل لبيئات WSL-Windows مع دمج Claude Code how to use practice-viriditas what is practice-viriditas practice-viriditas alternative practice-viriditas vs Claude Code practice-viriditas install practice-viriditas setup guide WSL-Windows development guides Claude Code integration Hildegardian contemplative spirituality practice-viriditas WSL-Windows Claude Code 开发环境 开发工具 AIエージェント 综合开发指南 Provides comprehensive development guides for WSL-Windows environments Integrates Claude Code for enhanced coding capabilities Supports Hildegardian contemplative spirituality and nature-inspired coding practices Offers meditation and philosophical contemplation guides for developers Enables integration with seasonal rhythms and natural world concepts Utilizes SKILL.md content for technical guidance and support practice-viriditas is a skill that offers comprehensive development guides for WSL-Windows environments with Claude Code integration, focusing on Hildegardian contemplative spirituality and nature-inspired coding practices.');
