-plan","desarrollo de equipo con CLI","orquestación de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["comment utiliser workflow-multi-cli-plan","outils d''agents d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à workflow-multi-cli-plan","workflow-multi-cli-plan vs autres","installation de workflow-multi-cli-plan","guide de configuration de workflow-multi-cli-plan","développement d''équipe avec CLI","orchestration de flux de travail"],"de":["wie man workflow-multi-cli-plan verwendet","KI-Agents-Tools","Alternativen zu workflow-multi-cli-plan","workflow-multi-cli-plan vs andere","Installation von workflow-multi-cli-plan","Konfigurationsanleitung für workflow-multi-cli-plan","Team-Entwicklung mit CLI","Workflow-Orchestrierung"],"pt":["como usar workflow-multi-cli-plan","o que é workflow-multi-cli-plan","ferramentas de agente de IA","workflow-multi-cli-plan alternativa","workflow-multi-cli-plan vs cli-tools","instalar workflow-multi-cli-plan","guia de configuração do workflow-multi-cli-plan"],"ru":["как использовать workflow-multi-cli-plan","что такое workflow-multi-cli-plan","инструменты ИИ Агентов","workflow-multi-cli-plan альтернатива","workflow-multi-cli-plan vs cli-tools","установить workflow-multi-cli-plan","руководство по настройке workflow-multi-cli-plan"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام workflow-multi-cli-plan","ما هو workflow-multi-cli-plan","أدوات العميل الذكي","workflow-multi-cli-plan بديل","workflow-multi-cli-plan vs cli-tools","تثبيت workflow-multi-cli-plan","دليل إعداد workflow-multi-cli-plan"]}},"owner":"catlog22","repo":"Claude-Code-Workflow","repoPath":"catlog22/Claude-Code-Workflow","stars":1382,"forks":113,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T09:48:04Z","topics":["claude","claude-code","cli-tools","codex","context-management","gemini-cli","json-driven","qwen-code","task-orchestration","workflow-automation"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow-multi-cli-plan","description":"Multi-CLI collaborative planning and execution skill with integrated execution phase. Triggers on workflow-multi-cli-plan.","bodyPreview":"# Workflow Multi-CLI Plan\n\nUnified multi-CLI collaborative planning and execution skill. Routes to multi-cli-plan (ACE context + multi-CLI discussion + plan generation) which then hands off to lite-execute (Phase 2) internally for execution.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SKILL.md (Router + Prompt Enhancement)                  │\n│  → Enhance prompt → Dispatch to Phase 1                 │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────","body":"# Workflow Multi-CLI Plan\n\nUnified multi-CLI collaborative planning and execution skill. Routes to multi-cli-plan (ACE context + multi-CLI discussion + plan generation) which then hands off to lite-execute (Phase 2) internally for execution.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SKILL.md (Router + Prompt Enhancement)                  │\n│  → Enhance prompt → Dispatch to Phase 1                 │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘\n                       │\n                       ↓\n     ┌──────────────┐        ┌───────────┐\n     │multi-cli-plan│        │lite-execute│\n     │   Phase 1    │─handoff→│  Phase 2   │\n     │  Plan+Exec   │        │ (internal) │\n     └──────────────┘        └───────────┘\n```\n\n## Mode Detection & Routing\n\n```javascript\nconst args = $ARGUMENTS\nconst mode = ''plan''  // workflow-multi-cli-plan always starts with planning\n```\n\n**Routing Table**:\n\n| Trigger | Mode | Phase Document | Description |\n|---------|------|----------------|-------------|\n| `workflow-multi-cli-plan` | plan | [phases/01-multi-cli-plan.md](phases/01-multi-cli-plan.md) | Multi-CLI collaborative planning (ACE context → discussion → plan → execute) |\n\n## Interactive Preference Collection\n\nBefore dispatching, collect workflow preferences via AskUserQuestion:\n\n```javascript\n// ★ 统一 auto mode 检测：-y/--yes 从 $ARGUMENTS 或 ccw 传播\nconst autoYes = /\\b(-y|--yes)\\b/.test($ARGUMENTS)\n\nif (autoYes) {\n  // 自动模式：跳过所有询问，使用默认值\n  workflowPreferences = { autoYes: true }\n} else if (mode === ''plan'') {\n  const prefResponse = AskUserQuestion({\n    questions: [\n      {\n        question: \"是否跳过所有确认步骤（自动模式）？\",\n        header: \"Auto Mode\",\n        multiSelect: false,\n        options: [\n          { label: \"Interactive (Recommended)\", description: \"交互模式，包含确认步骤\" },\n          { label: \"Auto\", description: \"跳过所有确认，自动执行\" }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  })\n  workflowPreferences = {\n    autoYes: prefResponse.autoMode === ''Auto''\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**workflowPreferences** is passed to phase execution as context variable, referenced as `workflowPreferences.autoYes` within phases.\n\n## Prompt Enhancement\n\nAfter collecting preferences, enhance context and dispatch:\n\n```javascript\n// Step 1: Load project context via ccw spec\nBash(''ccw spec load --category planning'')\n\n// Step 2: Log available context\nconsole.log(''Project context loaded via: ccw spec load --category planning'')\n\n// Step 3: Dispatch to Phase 1 (workflowPreferences available as context)\n// Read phases/01-multi-cli-plan.md and execute\n// Phase 1 internally hands off to Phase 2 (lite-execute) after plan approval\n```\n\n## Compact Recovery (Phase Persistence)\n\nMulti-phase execution (multi-cli-plan → lite-execute) spans long conversations. Uses **双重保险**: TodoWrite 跟踪 active phase 保护其不被压缩，sentinel 作为兜底。\n\n> **⚠️ COMPACT DIRECTIVE**: Context compression MUST check TodoWrite phase status.\n> The phase currently marked `in_progress` is the active execution phase — preserve its FULL content.\n> Only compress phases marked `completed` or `pending`.\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### Plan Mode (workflow-multi-cli-plan)\n\n```\n1. Collect preferences via AskUserQuestion (autoYes)\n2. Enhance prompt with project context availability\n3. Read phases/01-multi-cli-plan.md\n4. Execute multi-cli-plan pipeline (Phase 1-5 within the phase doc)\n5. Phase 5 directly reads and executes Phase 2 (lite-execute) with executionContext\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nTask description provided as arguments → interactive preference collection → multi-CLI planning pipeline → internal execution handoff to Phase 2 (lite-execute).\n\n## Phase Reference Documents\n\n| Phase | Document | Purpose | Compact |\n|-------|----------|---------|---------|\n| 1 | [phases/01-multi-cli-plan.md](phases/01-multi-cli-plan.md) | Complete multi-CLI planning pipeline: ACE context, iterative discussion, options, user decision, plan generation, handoff | TodoWrite 驱动 |\n| 2 | [phases/02-lite-execute.md](phases/02-lite-execute.md) | Complete execution engine: input modes, task grouping, batch execution, code review | TodoWrite 驱动 + 🔄 sentinel |\n\n**Compact Rules**:\n1. **TodoWrite `in_progress`** → 保留完整内容，禁止压缩\n2. **TodoWrite `completed`** → 可压缩为摘要\n3. **🔄 sentinel fallback** → Phase 2 包含 compact sentinel；若 compact 后仅存 sentinel 而无完整 Step 协议，必须立即 `Read(\"phases/02-lite-execute.md\")` 恢复\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:14:33.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring unified multi-CLI collaborative planning and execution capabilities.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要统一的多 CLI 协作规划和执行能力。","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、統一された多数の CLI コラボレーション計画と実行機能を必要とする。","ko":"AutoGPT 및 LangChain 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 통일된 다중 CLI 협력 계획 및 실행 기능을 필요로 함.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades de planificación y ejecución colaborativa unificadas multi-CLI.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA Avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de planification et d''exécution collaboratives unifiées multi-CLI.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die einheitliche multi-CLI-Kollaborationsplanungs- und Ausführungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem capacidades de planejamento e execução colaborativas multi-CLI unificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих унифицированных возможностей совместного планирования и выполнения multi-CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي المتقدمة مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب قابليات التخطيط والتنفيذ التعاوني المتعدد CLI الموحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate JSON-driven workflows with intelligent CLI tools like Gemini, Qwen, and Codex, leveraging context-first architecture for automated execution via protocols like multi-cli-plan and lite-execute.","zh":"使代理能够通过智能的 CLI 工具（如 Gemini、Qwen 和 Codex）编排基于 JSON 的工作流，并利用上下文优先架构通过协议（如 multi-cli-plan 和 lite-execute）实现自动化执行。","ja":"エージェントが Gemini、Qwen、Codex などのインテリジェントな CLI ツールを使用して JSON ドライブのワークフローをオーケストレートできるようにし、コンテキストファーストアーキテクチャを使用して multi-cli-plan や lite-execute などのプロトコルを介した自動化実行を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Gemini, Qwen, Codex 같은 지능형 CLI 도구를 사용하여 JSON 기반 워크플로우를 오케스트레이션 할 수 있도록 하며, 컨텍스트 우선 아키텍처를 사용하여 multi-cli-plan 및 lite-execute 같은 프로토콜을 통해 자동화 실행을 가능하게 함.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para orquestar flujos de trabajo impulsados por JSON con herramientas de CLI inteligentes como Gemini, Qwen y Codex, aprovechando la arquitectura de contexto primero para la ejecución automatizada a través de protocolos como multi-cli-plan y lite-execute.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer des flux de travail pilotés par JSON avec des outils de CLI intelligents comme Gemini, Qwen et Codex, en exploitant l''architecture de contexte premier pour l''exécution automatisée via des protocoles comme multi-cli-plan et lite-execute.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, JSON-getriebene Workflows mit intelligenten CLI-Tools wie Gemini, Qwen und Codex zu orchestrieren, indem sie die kontextbasierte Architektur für die automatisierte Ausführung über Protokolle wie multi-cli-plan und lite-execute nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar fluxos de trabalho impulsionados por JSON com ferramentas CLI inteligentes como Gemini, Qwen e Codex, aproveitando arquitetura orientada a contexto para execução automatizada via protocolos como multi-cli-plan e lite-execute.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать потоки работы на основе JSON с помощью интеллектуальных инструментов CLI, таких как Gemini, Qwen и Codex, используя архитектуру, ориентированную на контекст, для автоматизированного выполнения через протоколы, такие как multi-cli-plan и lite-execute.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق سلاسل العمل التي تعتمد على JSON باستخدام أدوات CLI الذكية مثل Gemini و Qwen و Codex، واستغلال هيكل متوافق مع السياق لتنفيذ آلي عبر بروتوكولات مثل multi-cli-plan و lite-execute."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating complex workflow executions across multiple CLIs","Generating collaborative plans through multi-CLI discussions","Optimizing workflow cadence with context-aware team development frameworks"],"zh":["跨多个 CLI 自动执行复杂的工作流","通过多 CLI 讨论生成协作计划","使用上下文感知团队开发框架优化工作流程节奏"],"ja":["複数の CLI 上で複雑なワークフローの自動実行","多数の CLI を介したディスカッションを通じたコラボレーション計画の生成","コンテキスト認識チーム開発フレームワークを使用したワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["다중 CLI 에서 복잡한 워크플로우 자동 실행","다중 CLI 논의를 통해 협력 계획 생성","컨텍스트 인식 팀 개발 프레임워크를 사용한 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de ejecuciones de flujos de trabajo complejos en múltiples CLIs","Generación de planes colaborativos a través de discusiones multi-CLI","Optimización del ritmo de trabajo con marcos de desarrollo de equipo conscientes del contexto"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exécution de flux de travail complexes sur plusieurs CLIs","Génération de plans collaboratifs via des discussions multi-CLI","Optimisation du rythme de travail avec des cadres de développement d''équipe sensibles au contexte"],"de":["Automatisierung von komplexen Workflow-Ausführungen über mehrere CLIs","Erstellung von kooperativen Plänen durch multi-CLI-Diskussionen","Optimierung des Arbeitsrhythmus mit kontextbewussten Team-Entwicklungsframeworks"],"pt":["Automatizar execuções de fluxos de trabalho complexos em várias CLIs","Gerar planos colaborativos por meio de discussões multi-CLI","Otimizar o ritmo do fluxo de trabalho com estruturas de desenvolvimento de equipe conscientes de contexto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение сложных рабочих процессов в нескольких CLIs","Генерировать совместные планы посредством обсуждений multi-CLI","Оптимизировать ритм рабочего процесса с помощью структур командного развития, осведомлённых о контексте"],"ar":["توفير تنفيذ تلقائي لعمليات سلاسل العمل المعقدة عبر عدة CLI","إنتاج خطط تعاونية من خلال مناقشات متعددة CLI","تحسين إيقاع سلاسل العمل باستخدام إطارات تطوير الفريق المطلع على السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JSON-driven workflow definitions","Dependent on compatible CLI tools like Gemini, Qwen, and Codex","Internal handoff to lite-execute for Phase 2 execution"],"zh":["需要基于 JSON 的工作流定义","依赖于兼容的 CLI 工具，如 Gemini、Qwen 和 Codex","内部交接到 lite-execute 用于第 2 阶段执行"],"ja":["JSON ドライブのワークフロー定義の必要性","Gemini、Qwen、Codex などの互換性のある CLI ツールへの依存","内部ハンドオーバーを lite-execute に行い、第 2 フェーズの実行を実施"],"ko":["JSON 기반 워크플로우 정의가 필요","Gemini, Qwen, Codex 같은 호환 CLI 도구에 의존","내부 전달을 lite-execute 로 하여 2 단계 실행"],"es":["Requiere definiciones de flujos de trabajo impulsados por JSON","Dependiente de herramientas de CLI compatibles como Gemini, Qwen y Codex","Entrega interna a lite-execute para la ejecución de la Fase 2"],"fr":["Nécessite des définitions de flux de travail pilotées par JSON","Dépendante d''outils de CLI compatibles comme Gemini, Qwen et Codex","Remise interne à lite-execute pour l''exécution de la Phase 2"],"de":["Benötigt JSON-getriebene Workflow-Definitionen","Abhängig von kompatiblen CLI-Tools wie Gemini, Qwen und Codex","Interne Übergabe an lite-execute für die Ausführung von Phase 2"],"pt":["Exige definições de fluxos de trabalho impulsionados por JSON","Depende de ferramentas CLI compatíveis como Gemini, Qwen e Codex","Entrega interna para lite-execute para execução da Fase 2"],"ru":["Требует определений рабочих процессов на основе JSON","Зависит от совместимых инструментов CLI, таких как Gemini, Qwen и Codex","Внутренняя передача в lite-execute для выполнения фазы 2"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفات لسلاسل العمل التي تعتمد على JSON","يعتمد على أدوات CLI المتوافقة مثل Gemini و Qwen و Codex","تسليم داخلي إلى lite-execute لتنفيذ المرحلة 2"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8a246dfe949c11d3e89293c976040a072c2168ea399c593163d567bd7816007f","qualityScore":61}');
