о по ...","ar":"تعرف على كيفية استخدام openspec-continue-change للاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات باستخدام Electron ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي. احصل على دليل خطوة بخطوة للتعريف ..."},"definition":{"en":"openspec-continue-change is a skill that allows users to continue working on a change by creating the next artifact, utilizing the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool.","zh":"openspec-continue-change 是一个用于管理 Electron 应用程序账户和进程的 AI 工具","ja":"openspec-continue-change は Electron アプリケーションのアカウントとプロセスを管理する AI エージェントです","ko":"openspec-continue-change는 Electron 애플리케이션의 계정 및 프로세스를 관리하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"openspec-continue-change es una herramienta de línea de comandos (CLI) para gestionar cambios en aplicaciones","fr":"openspec-continue-change est un outil de ligne de commande (CLI) pour gérer les modifications dans les applications","de":"openspec-continue-change ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool (CLI) zur Verwaltung von Änderungen in Anwendungen","pt":"O openspec-continue-change é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para continuar trabalhando em alterações com o Electron.","ru":"openspec-continue-change - это консольный инструмент для продолжения работы над изменениями с помощью Electron и ИИ Агентов.","ar":"openspec-continue-change هو أداة سطر الأوامر للاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات باستخدام Electron ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Runs `openspec list --json` to retrieve available changes sorted by most recently modified","Utilizes the AskUserQuestion tool to prompt users for change selection","Presents top 3-5 changes for user selection","Optionally accepts a change name as input","Infer change name from conversation context if not provided","Supports Electron-based application lifecycle control"],"zh":["支持 Electron 应用程序账户和进程管理","提供无缝的接口来切换账户、备份进度和控制应用程序生命周期","使用 openspec list --json 获取可用变化","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具让用户选择要处理的变化","支持顶级 3-5 个最近修改的变化"],"ja":["Electron アプリケーションのアカウントとプロセスを管理する","アカウントを切り替え、進度をバックアップし、アプリケーションのライフサイクルを制御するためのシームレスなインターフェイスを提供する","openspec list --json を使用して利用可能な変更を取得する","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用して、ユーザーがどの変更を処理するかを選択する","トップ 3-5 の最近修正された変更をサポートする"],"ko":["Electron 애플리케이션의 계정 및 프로세스를 관리한다","계정을 전환하고, 진행 상황을 백업하고, 애플리케이션의 수명주기를 제어하기 위한 무결점 인터페이스를 제공한다","openspec list --json을 사용하여 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 가져온다","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자가 어떤 변경 사항을 처리할지 선택한다","최근 수정된 상위 3-5개의 변경 사항을 지원한다"],"es":["Selección de cambios mediante la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecución de `openspec list --json` para obtener cambios disponibles","Gestión del ciclo de vida de la aplicación","Compatibilidad con Electron","Integración con Gemini API"],"fr":["Sélection de modifications à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de `openspec list --json` pour obtenir les modifications disponibles","Gestion du cycle de vie de l''application","Compatibilité avec Electron","Intégration avec Gemini API"],"de":["Auswahl von Änderungen mit der AskUserQuestion-Tool","Ausführung von `openspec list --json` zur Abrufung verfügbarer Änderungen","Verwaltung des Lebenszyklus der Anwendung","Kompatibilität mit Electron","Integration mit Gemini API"],"pt":["Suporte ao Electron para gerenciamento de contas e processos","Interface para selecionar alterações e criar artefatos","Utilização do AskUserQuestion tool para seleção de alterações","Execução do comando openspec list --json para obter alterações disponíveis","Suporte à inferência de nomes de alterações a partir do contexto da conversa"],"ru":["Поддержка Electron для управления учетными записями и процессами","Интерфейс для выбора изменений и создания артефактов","Использование AskUserQuestion tool для выбора изменений","Выполнение команды openspec list --json для получения доступных изменений","Поддержка вывода имен изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["دعم Electron لإدارة الحسابات والعمليات","واجهة لتحديد التغييرات وإنشاء الملفات المطلوبة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لتحديد التغييرات","تشغيل الأمر openspec list --json لاسترداد التغييرات المتاحة","دعم استنتاج أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change setup guide","what is openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change alternative","openspec-continue-change vs antigravity","openspec-continue-change install","electron-based application development","antigravity application management","account manager for antigravity"],"zh":["openspec-continue-change","Electron 应用程序","账户管理","进程管理","AI 工具","openspec list --json","AskUserQuestion"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","Electron アプリケーション","アカウント管理","プロセス管理","AI エージェント","openspec list --json","AskUserQuestion"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","Electron 애플리케이션","계정 관리","프로세스 관리","AI 에이전트","openspec list --json","AskUserQuestion"],"es":["herramientas de AI","agentes de AI","openspec-continue-change","gestión de cambios","Electron","Gemini API","CLI","AskUserQuestion","ciclo de vida de la aplicación"],"fr":["outils d''IA","agents d''IA","openspec-continue-change","gestion des modifications","Electron","Gemini API","CLI","AskUserQuestion","cycle de vie de l''application"],"de":["AI-Tools","AI-Agents","openspec-continue-change","Änderungsverwaltung","Electron","Gemini API","CLI","AskUserQuestion","Lebenszyklus der Anwendung"],"pt":["openspec-continue-change","Electron","gerenciamento de contas","processos","AskUserQuestion tool","openspec list --json","inferência de nomes de alterações","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-continue-change","Electron","управление учетными записями","процессы","AskUserQuestion tool","openspec list --json","вывод имен изменений","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["openspec-continue-change","Electron","إدارة الحسابات","عمليات","أداة AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","استنتاج أسماء التغييرات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Draculabo","repo":"AntigravityManager","repoPath":"Draculabo/AntigravityManager","stars":1001,"forks":133,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T11:34:38Z","topics":["account-manager","antigravity","antigravity-ai","antigravity-ide","antigravity-tools","antigravity2api","electron","gemini","gemini-api","gemini-pro"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:26:13.174Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing seamless account switching and progress backup in Electron-based projects.","zh":"非常适合需要在Electron-based项目中实现无缝账户切换和进度备份的开发代理。","ja":"Electronベースのプロジェクトでシームレスなアカウント切替と進度バックアップを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Electron 기반 프로젝트에서 무중단 계정 전환과 진행 상황 백업이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan conmutación de cuenta sin problemas y respaldo de progreso en proyectos basados en Electron.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant un commutateur de compte sans interruption et une sauvegarde de progrès dans les projets basés sur Electron.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die ein nahtloses Konto-Wechseln und eine Fortschritts-Sicherung in Electron-basierten Projekten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de alternância de conta sem interrupções e backup de progresso em projetos baseados em Electron.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима бесшовная переключение учетных записей и резервное копирование прогресса в проектах на основе Electron.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى تبديل حساب دون انقطاع ونسخ احتياطي للتقدم في مشاريع قائم على Electron."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, leveraging the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool for efficient change selection, and utilizing JSON output for streamlined project management.","zh":"通过创建下一个工件，利用openspec list命令和AskUserQuestion工具进行高效的更改选择，并利用JSON输出实现流畅的项目管理，从而使代理能够继续处理更改。","ja":"次のアーティファクトを作成し、openspec listコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールを使用して効率的な変更の選択を行い、JSON出力を使用してスムーズなプロジェクト管理を行うことで、エージェントが変更を続行できるようにします。","ko":"다음 아티팩트를 생성하고, openspec list 명령 및 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 효율적인 변경 선택을 수행하며, JSON 출력을 사용하여 원활한 프로젝트 관리를 통해 에이전트가 변경을 계속할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a continuar trabajando en los cambios creando el próximo artefacto, aprovechando el comando de lista openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para una selección de cambios eficiente, y utilizando la salida JSON para una gestión de proyectos optimizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les modifications en créant le prochain artefact, en exploitant la commande de liste openspec et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une sélection de modifications efficace, et en utilisant la sortie JSON pour une gestion de projet rationalisée.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, an den Änderungen weiterzuarbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, die openspec-Listenbefehl und das AskUserQuestion-Tool für eine effiziente Änderungsauswahl nutzen und die JSON-Ausgabe für eine optimierte Projektverwaltung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a continuar trabalhando em alterações criando o próximo artifact, utilizando o comando openspec list e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção eficiente de alterações, e utilizando a saída JSON para gerenciamento de projeto otimizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью продолжать работать над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду openspec list и инструмент AskUserQuestion для эффективного выбора изменений, и используя вывод JSON для оптимизированного управления проектом.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مواصلة العمل على التغييرات من خلال إنشاء الملف التالي، واستخدام lệnh openspec list وأداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار التغييرات بكفاءة، واستخدام الإخراج JSON لإدارة المشروع المتدفق."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing interrupted changes","Switching between multiple development accounts","Backing up project progress"],"zh":["继续中断的更改","在多个开发账户之间切换","备份项目进度"],"ja":["中断された変更の続行","複数の開発アカウント間の切換え","プロジェクト進度のバックアップ"],"ko":["중단된 변경의 계속","複数 개발 계정 간 전환","프로젝트 진행 상황 백업"],"es":["Continuar cambios interrumpidos","Conmutar entre varias cuentas de desarrollo","Respaldar el progreso del proyecto"],"fr":["Continuer les modifications interrompues","Basculer entre plusieurs comptes de développement","Sauvegarder la progression du projet"],"de":["Unterbrochene Änderungen fortsetzen","Zwischen mehreren Entwicklungskonten wechseln","Projektfortschritt sichern"],"pt":["Continuar alterações interrompidas","Alternar entre várias contas de desenvolvimento","Fazer backup do progresso do projeto"],"ru":["Продолжить прерванные изменения","Переключаться между несколькими учетными записями разработки","Создать резервную копию прогресса проекта"],"ar":["استمرار التغييرات المتوقفة","تبديل بين حسابات متعددة للتطوير","نسخ احتياطي للتقدم في المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Electron-based project environment","Dependent on openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool functionality"],"zh":["需要Electron-based项目环境","依赖openspec list命令和AskUserQuestion工具的功能"],"ja":["Electronベースのプロジェクト環境が必要","openspec listコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールの機能に依存"],"ko":["Electron 기반 프로젝트 환경 필요","openspec list 명령 및 AskUserQuestion 도구의 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de proyecto basado en Electron","Dependiente de la funcionalidad del comando de lista openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de projet basé sur Electron","Dépend de la fonctionnalité de la commande de liste openspec et de l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Benötigt eine Electron-basierte Projekumgebung","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des openspec-Listenbefehls und des AskUserQuestion-Tools"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de projeto baseado em Electron","Dependente da funcionalidade do comando openspec list e da ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Требует среды проекта на основе Electron","Зависит от функциональности команды openspec list и инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة مشروع قائم على Electron","يعتمد على وظيفة 命令 openspec list وأداة AskUserQuestion"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5fbcfc9f2fa055c153542d0fec06ffadd1321ab3aaeb76e4061756f490c16b1e","qualityScore":60}');
